1
00:00:00,247 --> 00:00:03,049
(The last evening at the House arrives.)

2
00:00:07,020 --> 00:00:07,988
(Gets up)

3
00:00:08,888 --> 00:00:13,593
(A text gets Jong Eun on his feet.)

4
00:00:17,897 --> 00:00:20,033
"Check the table
in the first-floor living room."

5
00:00:20,901 --> 00:00:21,801
Really?

6
00:00:23,203 --> 00:00:25,272
It says to check the living room table.

7
00:00:25,272 --> 00:00:25,939
What?

8
00:00:31,578 --> 00:00:34,681
(A mysterious box in the living room)

9
00:00:35,315 --> 00:00:36,182
Gosh.

10
00:00:37,217 --> 00:00:38,451
- What is it?
- I can't look.

11
00:00:39,953 --> 00:00:41,154
(Curious)

12
00:00:41,821 --> 00:00:42,889
This is driving me crazy.

13
00:00:48,094 --> 00:00:49,362
"It's the day before the final choice."

14
00:00:49,362 --> 00:00:50,931
"Write down a question"...

15
00:00:50,931 --> 00:00:52,799
"and leave it anonymously in the box."

16
00:00:53,733 --> 00:00:58,805
(One day before the final choice,
a truth game to reveal their feelings)

17
00:00:58,805 --> 00:01:00,307
(Lee Se Young)

18
00:01:00,307 --> 00:01:01,274
Finally.

19
00:01:01,274 --> 00:01:02,342
The time has come.

20
00:01:02,342 --> 00:01:04,544
If they give vague answers again,

21
00:01:04,544 --> 00:01:06,513
shouldn't there be a penalty?

22
00:01:06,513 --> 00:01:08,548
They should have to answer yes or no.

23
00:01:08,548 --> 00:01:09,916
Yes or no.

24
00:01:09,916 --> 00:01:12,385
Once today is over,

25
00:01:12,385 --> 00:01:16,222
only the final choice will remain.

26
00:01:16,222 --> 00:01:19,092
So today is extremely important.

27
00:01:19,092 --> 00:01:19,993
This is where it gets real.

28
00:01:19,993 --> 00:01:21,494
It all starts now.

29
00:01:22,162 --> 00:01:23,330
A truth game?

30
00:01:24,965 --> 00:01:26,499
This is huge.

31
00:01:26,499 --> 00:01:27,167
A truth game.

32
00:01:28,034 --> 00:01:29,336
This is huge.

33
00:01:29,336 --> 00:01:32,839
I think they'll recognize my handwriting.

34
00:01:32,839 --> 00:01:35,275
Should I disguise it on purpose?

35
00:01:35,275 --> 00:01:37,510
It'd be no fun if they know it's a woman.

36
00:01:38,411 --> 00:01:39,546
(Tense)

37
00:01:40,547 --> 00:01:44,184
(Some have avoided this moment.)

38
00:01:44,618 --> 00:01:48,321
(Others have waited for it.)

39
00:01:48,988 --> 00:01:50,156
Should we each go write our questions?

40
00:01:50,156 --> 00:01:51,691
Let's do it.

41
00:01:51,691 --> 00:01:52,925
Let's write them and meet back here.

42
00:01:55,127 --> 00:01:59,398
(What truths will they face tonight?)

43
00:02:04,470 --> 00:02:05,404
- What?
- Is everyone here?

44
00:02:05,404 --> 00:02:07,373
Everyone, gather in the living room.

45
00:02:07,974 --> 00:02:11,978
(They write questions and all gather.)

46
00:02:12,678 --> 00:02:14,647
(Complicated feelings before the game)

47
00:02:14,647 --> 00:02:16,482
It's just...

48
00:02:16,983 --> 00:02:20,707
Tomorrow is really the end,

49
00:02:20,708 --> 00:02:22,855
and I knew I might regret it.

50
00:02:22,855 --> 00:02:25,458
So I wanted to make my feelings clear.

51
00:02:27,593 --> 00:02:30,663
I wanted to know more.

52
00:02:30,663 --> 00:02:31,597
Just tell me now.

53
00:02:31,597 --> 00:02:32,531
Is it me or her?

54
00:02:33,933 --> 00:02:36,302
That question puts me in a tough spot.

55
00:02:37,269 --> 00:02:40,740
Would I hear a more honest answer?

56
00:02:41,240 --> 00:02:43,509
I think I wanted some clarity...

57
00:02:43,509 --> 00:02:44,710
through that question.

58
00:02:46,145 --> 00:02:48,914
It made me want to learn more.

59
00:02:49,849 --> 00:02:51,150
We're finally doing it.

60
00:02:51,150 --> 00:02:54,520
This will be such an important night.

61
00:02:55,488 --> 00:02:58,658
We'll get to see how everyone feels.

62
00:02:58,658 --> 00:03:00,159
I was a little excited.

63
00:03:01,694 --> 00:03:05,631
(The truth game begins
with everyone hiding different feelings.)

64
00:03:06,165 --> 00:03:07,733
(Nervous)

65
00:03:08,567 --> 00:03:09,702
Let's see.

66
00:03:09,702 --> 00:03:10,903
(Ro Bin draws the first question.)

67
00:03:10,903 --> 00:03:12,338
Ryun Gi.

68
00:03:12,338 --> 00:03:16,542
Describe your most thrilling date
and a specific moment.

69
00:03:17,376 --> 00:03:19,779
(A written-response question right away)

70
00:03:19,779 --> 00:03:21,981
"Describe."

71
00:03:21,981 --> 00:03:23,516
"Describe it."

72
00:03:23,516 --> 00:03:25,184
Is this the SAT?

73
00:03:27,086 --> 00:03:30,289
My most thrilling...

74
00:03:31,791 --> 00:03:33,459
(Curious)

75
00:03:33,726 --> 00:03:36,295
It wasn't a planned date,

76
00:03:38,064 --> 00:03:39,231
but,

77
00:03:40,333 --> 00:03:41,233
somehow,

78
00:03:44,003 --> 00:03:46,272
the laundromat date stands out...

79
00:03:46,272 --> 00:03:47,540
because it felt so...

80
00:03:49,775 --> 00:03:51,210
(Shy)

81
00:03:51,210 --> 00:03:55,648
(The laundromat date with Ro Bin)

82
00:03:55,648 --> 00:03:58,617
It didn't feel staged.

83
00:04:00,419 --> 00:04:02,822
The atmosphere felt so comfortable.

84
00:04:08,160 --> 00:04:09,562
A specific moment?

85
00:04:10,863 --> 00:04:13,265
The laundromat was on the left.

86
00:04:13,265 --> 00:04:14,400
My goodness.

87
00:04:15,701 --> 00:04:19,538
With tables and chairs outside.

88
00:04:19,538 --> 00:04:22,008
We watched two fixie bikes pass by.

89
00:04:22,541 --> 00:04:23,809
Those moments.

90
00:04:23,809 --> 00:04:25,077
That's incredibly specific.

91
00:04:28,814 --> 00:04:29,715
Suddenly,

92
00:04:31,083 --> 00:04:34,887
I wasn't a sick person talking to her.

93
00:04:34,887 --> 00:04:37,323
We were just two people.

94
00:04:38,557 --> 00:04:43,529
I kept forgetting I was sick. That was...

95
00:04:44,463 --> 00:04:45,665
so deeply...

96
00:04:49,769 --> 00:04:51,270
comforting to me.

97
00:04:51,504 --> 00:04:53,272
That's why it thrilled me even more.

98
00:04:54,607 --> 00:04:55,941
- That's great.
- I love it.

99
00:04:56,409 --> 00:04:57,643
(That's it.)

100
00:04:57,643 --> 00:04:58,878
(Exactly)

101
00:04:59,812 --> 00:05:01,113
Good job, Ryun Gi.

102
00:05:01,113 --> 00:05:02,048
Perfect.

103
00:05:02,048 --> 00:05:03,015
I love it.

104
00:05:03,015 --> 00:05:04,016
When a man...

105
00:05:04,016 --> 00:05:06,018
speaks confidently in public, it's great.

106
00:05:06,018 --> 00:05:07,219
Exactly.

107
00:05:07,219 --> 00:05:08,721
Who wouldn't love that?

108
00:05:08,721 --> 00:05:11,257
He told her how much fun he had,

109
00:05:11,257 --> 00:05:12,525
what happened and what he loved.

110
00:05:12,525 --> 00:05:14,593
He remembered every detail.
Who wouldn't love that?

111
00:05:15,294 --> 00:05:17,630
- It's so sweet and exciting.
- Yes.

112
00:05:18,831 --> 00:05:19,699
A perfect score.

113
00:05:19,699 --> 00:05:21,000
That's a perfect score.

114
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:22,034
(Impressed)

115
00:05:22,768 --> 00:05:23,803
Why are you clapping?

116
00:05:23,803 --> 00:05:25,371
- That was great.
- It was.

117
00:05:25,371 --> 00:05:28,174
That's how a man should describe it.

118
00:05:28,174 --> 00:05:30,042
- It's over.
- That was great.

119
00:05:31,410 --> 00:05:33,813
Whenever Ryun Gi answered,

120
00:05:33,813 --> 00:05:35,815
I felt so shy.

121
00:05:36,782 --> 00:05:39,852
I kept squirming in my seat,

122
00:05:39,852 --> 00:05:40,820
and...

123
00:05:42,154 --> 00:05:45,658
I think everything went silent then.

124
00:05:47,660 --> 00:05:51,130
(Ryun Gi's answer thrills Ro Bin.)

125
00:05:51,630 --> 00:05:52,665
This is giving me butterflies.

126
00:05:54,834 --> 00:05:58,070
(Ryun Gi's feelings reached Ro Bin.)

127
00:05:59,472 --> 00:06:02,575
(Seon Ho draws the next question.)

128
00:06:02,942 --> 00:06:04,143
(Startled)

129
00:06:05,111 --> 00:06:06,078
Do Gon.

130
00:06:07,046 --> 00:06:12,018
Are you romantically open
to all the women?

131
00:06:14,520 --> 00:06:19,458
(A question about
Do Gon's devotion to Ro Bin)

132
00:06:23,095 --> 00:06:25,631
I already knew who I liked.

133
00:06:28,801 --> 00:06:32,505
If someone else had really pursued you,

134
00:06:32,505 --> 00:06:34,006
would there still have been no chance?

135
00:06:35,908 --> 00:06:36,976
I don't think so.

136
00:06:40,413 --> 00:06:41,681
What a man.

137
00:06:41,681 --> 00:06:43,349
Seriously?

138
00:06:43,349 --> 00:06:44,450
To the very end.

139
00:06:44,450 --> 00:06:46,319
He's unwavering.

140
00:06:46,319 --> 00:06:47,953
- Do Gon knows what he wants.
- So cool.

141
00:06:47,953 --> 00:06:50,122
He's a real man. He's incredible.

142
00:06:50,122 --> 00:06:51,657
Straight and simple.

143
00:06:51,657 --> 00:06:53,059
I love it, Do Gon.

144
00:06:54,026 --> 00:06:55,561
That was the best.

145
00:06:56,295 --> 00:07:00,599
(Do Gon's heart never wavered.)

146
00:07:03,469 --> 00:07:06,505
Every time Do Gon spoke,

147
00:07:06,973 --> 00:07:10,276
he never evaded anything.

148
00:07:10,276 --> 00:07:12,712
He was honest...

149
00:07:12,712 --> 00:07:15,014
about his feelings.

150
00:07:15,014 --> 00:07:16,916
That really moved me.

151
00:07:18,351 --> 00:07:21,354
(Can Do Gon's sincerity
change Ro Bin's heart?)

152
00:07:23,389 --> 00:07:24,323
"To Ye Ji."

153
00:07:24,924 --> 00:07:27,927
(A question for Ye Ji before Na Young)

154
00:07:28,127 --> 00:07:31,564
Which moment from your dates
would you return to?

155
00:07:33,733 --> 00:07:35,301
Return to?

156
00:07:37,436 --> 00:07:41,607
(Four dates with Seon Ho over six days)

157
00:07:42,508 --> 00:07:44,377
(Thinks)

158
00:07:45,578 --> 00:07:48,914
(The one moment Ye Ji wants to revisit)

159
00:07:49,782 --> 00:07:50,783
For me,

160
00:07:52,351 --> 00:07:53,352
day one.

161
00:07:53,786 --> 00:07:56,589
The first date is the moment I'd revisit.

162
00:07:59,659 --> 00:08:06,465
(The moments with Seon Ho
that Ye Ji wants to revisit)

163
00:08:08,534 --> 00:08:11,337
The first date is the moment I'd revisit.

164
00:08:11,337 --> 00:08:12,171
Why?

165
00:08:12,438 --> 00:08:13,639
I want to know why too.

166
00:08:13,639 --> 00:08:14,607
Because...

167
00:08:16,042 --> 00:08:17,610
Well...

168
00:08:28,054 --> 00:08:29,588
It made my heart race the most.

169
00:08:32,825 --> 00:08:36,729
(She reveals her feelings for Seon Ho.)

170
00:08:48,074 --> 00:08:50,209
I thought, "I need to hide my reaction."

171
00:08:50,209 --> 00:08:52,979
But I'm bad at hiding it.

172
00:08:55,014 --> 00:08:56,549
I couldn't control my expression.

173
00:08:57,550 --> 00:08:59,452
I'm not sure how I looked,

174
00:09:00,553 --> 00:09:02,054
but I tried to keep a straight face.

175
00:09:02,054 --> 00:09:03,556
It didn't work very well.

176
00:09:05,024 --> 00:09:09,562
(She no longer hides her feelings.)

177
00:09:11,063 --> 00:09:12,131
Seon Ho.

178
00:09:14,700 --> 00:09:17,436
Tell us when your heart pounded most.

179
00:09:17,436 --> 00:09:18,504
Be specific.

180
00:09:21,807 --> 00:09:23,175
Look at him.

181
00:09:24,410 --> 00:09:25,144
(Surprised)

182
00:09:25,911 --> 00:09:26,879
My goodness.

183
00:09:27,980 --> 00:09:30,650
You can't dodge this one.

184
00:09:30,650 --> 00:09:32,785
If you dodge this, you're in trouble.

185
00:09:33,653 --> 00:09:34,654
Be specific.

186
00:09:34,654 --> 00:09:35,821
That wasn't scary at all.

187
00:09:35,821 --> 00:09:37,390
(Caught)

188
00:09:38,524 --> 00:09:39,558
You still can't dodge it.

189
00:09:39,558 --> 00:09:40,292
Just tell us.

190
00:09:40,292 --> 00:09:41,227
You have to answer.

191
00:09:41,227 --> 00:09:42,962
It's time.

192
00:09:46,565 --> 00:09:48,234
This one is intense right away.

193
00:09:49,635 --> 00:09:51,771
- Be specific.
- Be specific.

194
00:09:56,142 --> 00:09:57,510
(Glances)

195
00:09:58,177 --> 00:09:58,978
Be specific?

196
00:09:58,978 --> 00:10:00,913
When your heart pounded the most.

197
00:10:02,648 --> 00:10:05,284
The moment his heart pounded most...

198
00:10:05,284 --> 00:10:07,053
Wasn't it with me?

199
00:10:09,522 --> 00:10:12,158
(Last night)

200
00:10:13,025 --> 00:10:17,563
(Their first date sparked
an intense attraction.)

201
00:10:18,497 --> 00:10:22,168
(Will Seon Ho recall the same moment?)

202
00:10:22,768 --> 00:10:26,973
I thought our feelings were so obvious...

203
00:10:26,973 --> 00:10:28,441
that we didn't need a truth game.

204
00:10:28,441 --> 00:10:31,210
But I wanted to hear him say it.

205
00:10:32,478 --> 00:10:35,614
So I wanted to settle it for good.

206
00:10:35,881 --> 00:10:38,884
I asked him to describe...

207
00:10:39,752 --> 00:10:42,188
when his heart pounded the most.

208
00:10:42,488 --> 00:10:46,325
(Na Young's anonymous question
for Seon Ho)

209
00:10:47,760 --> 00:10:54,734
(Will Na Young hear the answer she wants?)

210
00:10:56,869 --> 00:10:59,138
(Stares)

211
00:11:02,375 --> 00:11:03,843
The day my heart pounded most?

212
00:11:05,711 --> 00:11:08,581
Yes. Tell us when it pounded most.

213
00:11:08,581 --> 00:11:09,649
Be specific.

214
00:11:10,650 --> 00:11:13,219
(Thinks)

215
00:11:14,387 --> 00:11:18,190
(His brief but intense time with Na Young)

216
00:11:18,691 --> 00:11:23,396
(His growing connection with Ye Ji)

217
00:11:24,263 --> 00:11:28,100
(Who will Seon Ho's answer point to?)

218
00:11:28,501 --> 00:11:30,770
I think it was the first day.

219
00:11:35,628 --> 00:11:36,662
Because...

220
00:11:38,431 --> 00:11:39,565
on the first day,

221
00:11:43,035 --> 00:11:46,272
neither of us knew who would show up.

222
00:11:46,939 --> 00:11:49,942
But we still got matched for a date.

223
00:11:53,346 --> 00:11:57,984
(Seon Ho's vague explanation)

224
00:11:59,485 --> 00:12:00,386
(Tilts head)

225
00:12:03,956 --> 00:12:04,891
Wait a minute.

226
00:12:05,391 --> 00:12:08,194
I think we mean something different.

227
00:12:08,427 --> 00:12:09,662
By "heart pounding"...

228
00:12:09,662 --> 00:12:12,732
My heart pounded
the first time I had Coke.

229
00:12:13,633 --> 00:12:16,202
When we first filmed this show,

230
00:12:16,202 --> 00:12:17,036
my heart pounded so hard.

231
00:12:17,036 --> 00:12:19,071
When I entered this studio...

232
00:12:19,071 --> 00:12:20,039
My heart was racing too.

233
00:12:20,039 --> 00:12:22,308
Is that the kind of thrill he means?

234
00:12:22,308 --> 00:12:23,476
I think so.

235
00:12:23,476 --> 00:12:25,111
Seon Ho must have known...

236
00:12:25,111 --> 00:12:26,612
that wasn't what she meant.

237
00:12:26,612 --> 00:12:29,882
Still, she asked when his heart pounded.

238
00:12:29,882 --> 00:12:31,317
I think he dodged it well.

239
00:12:33,686 --> 00:12:34,687
(Her inner voice bursts out again.)

240
00:12:34,687 --> 00:12:35,888
He dodged it.

241
00:12:36,188 --> 00:12:38,224
- You think he dodged it well?
- Yes.

242
00:12:39,559 --> 00:12:41,827
- He got away.
- Yes.

243
00:12:41,827 --> 00:12:43,963
This is driving me crazy.

244
00:12:43,963 --> 00:12:46,032
You can dodge it that way?

245
00:12:46,032 --> 00:12:48,267
That's not the answer Na Young wanted.

246
00:12:48,267 --> 00:12:49,569
It wasn't.

247
00:12:49,569 --> 00:12:51,737
And it's not what Ye Ji wanted either.

248
00:12:51,737 --> 00:12:52,738
Exactly.

249
00:12:54,540 --> 00:12:56,275
I think it was on the first day.

250
00:13:06,085 --> 00:13:07,453
I got confused all over again...

251
00:13:07,453 --> 00:13:09,689
the moment I heard that.

252
00:13:09,689 --> 00:13:11,457
Then I started overthinking again.

253
00:13:13,226 --> 00:13:14,493
(Sighs)

254
00:13:14,493 --> 00:13:17,263
I just thought,

255
00:13:17,263 --> 00:13:19,732
"That's so Seon Ho."

256
00:13:19,966 --> 00:13:21,534
How could he answer like that?

257
00:13:21,534 --> 00:13:22,468
Back then,

258
00:13:23,469 --> 00:13:25,972
I wondered if I'd imagined it.

259
00:13:25,972 --> 00:13:28,341
I truly believed it at the time.

260
00:13:29,408 --> 00:13:31,944
Did I mean that little to him?

261
00:13:33,913 --> 00:13:35,448
Was I the only one feeling this?

262
00:13:37,183 --> 00:13:40,019
(Seon Ho's answer...)

263
00:13:40,019 --> 00:13:45,658
(leaves everyone confused.)

264
00:13:50,930 --> 00:13:53,032
"To Seon Ho."

265
00:13:53,032 --> 00:13:55,034
(Tense)

266
00:13:55,768 --> 00:13:59,505
Who is on your mind the most right now?

267
00:14:04,143 --> 00:14:05,211
That's intense.

268
00:14:05,211 --> 00:14:06,746
When his heart pounded...

269
00:14:07,680 --> 00:14:09,448
and who's on his mind.

270
00:14:11,217 --> 00:14:13,052
Who's on your mind the most?

271
00:14:15,888 --> 00:14:17,189
Who's on my mind the most?

272
00:14:28,501 --> 00:14:30,603
(Watches closely)

273
00:14:32,838 --> 00:14:34,807
He thought for a long time.

274
00:14:36,309 --> 00:14:38,210
He kept going back and forth.

275
00:14:39,245 --> 00:14:43,015
Seeing how unsure he really was,

276
00:14:44,450 --> 00:14:46,419
I wondered why.

277
00:14:52,758 --> 00:14:54,894
I'll say...

278
00:14:55,828 --> 00:14:57,997
Ye Ji is on my mind the most.

279
00:15:03,369 --> 00:15:08,808
(Seon Ho's answer points to Ye Ji.)

280
00:15:10,776 --> 00:15:15,047
Of course I wanted him to say my name.

281
00:15:15,047 --> 00:15:17,216
But having someone in one's mind...

282
00:15:17,216 --> 00:15:18,651
can mean many things.

283
00:15:18,885 --> 00:15:22,021
Maybe he feels bad for that person.

284
00:15:22,021 --> 00:15:24,624
Or maybe he's genuinely drawn
to that person.

285
00:15:24,624 --> 00:15:27,493
It can mean too many things
to jump to conclusions.

286
00:15:28,194 --> 00:15:32,098
(How did Seon Ho interpret "on my mind?")

287
00:15:32,598 --> 00:15:33,766
Is it my turn?

288
00:15:33,766 --> 00:15:34,767
Yes.

289
00:15:36,836 --> 00:15:40,172
Na Young, what kind of date...

290
00:15:40,172 --> 00:15:43,042
would you like with the person you like?

291
00:15:43,042 --> 00:15:46,379
And why do you want to go on that date?

292
00:15:51,217 --> 00:15:52,585
This is driving me crazy.

293
00:15:53,853 --> 00:15:55,288
Isn't that too many questions?

294
00:15:57,757 --> 00:15:59,091
The person I like is Seon Ho.

295
00:15:59,825 --> 00:16:01,027
What was the next question?

296
00:16:01,527 --> 00:16:03,129
The person I like is Seon Ho.

297
00:16:03,629 --> 00:16:04,830
What was the next question?

298
00:16:04,830 --> 00:16:05,698
(Flustered)

299
00:16:06,365 --> 00:16:07,667
The person?

300
00:16:09,101 --> 00:16:10,970
- It didn't ask who.
- It didn't?

301
00:16:11,470 --> 00:16:13,239
No? I'm sorry.

302
00:16:13,239 --> 00:16:14,674
Isn't that what it asked?

303
00:16:15,141 --> 00:16:16,609
(Shy)

304
00:16:20,012 --> 00:16:22,181
He's delighted.

305
00:16:23,249 --> 00:16:25,251
Na Young gives him so much reassurance.

306
00:16:25,918 --> 00:16:27,486
It asked if you liked someone.

307
00:16:27,486 --> 00:16:28,988
Yes, I do.

308
00:16:28,988 --> 00:16:31,757
- Yeah, you just said his name.
- It doesn't matter.

309
00:16:35,027 --> 00:16:35,928
(Blushes)

310
00:16:35,928 --> 00:16:36,929
His ears are turning red.

311
00:16:40,366 --> 00:16:42,068
Hold on. They're so red.

312
00:16:42,068 --> 00:16:43,603
What? What's with him?

313
00:16:44,237 --> 00:16:48,507
(Na Young's confession
sets Seon Ho's ears ablaze.)

314
00:16:48,507 --> 00:16:49,709
I mean...

315
00:16:49,709 --> 00:16:50,910
Anyway...

316
00:16:52,878 --> 00:16:55,147
What kind of date would you want outside?

317
00:16:55,147 --> 00:16:56,482
Outside.

318
00:16:56,482 --> 00:16:58,484
What kind of date would you want outside?

319
00:16:58,484 --> 00:17:00,820
And why would you want to go on it?

320
00:17:03,923 --> 00:17:05,057
I'd go on a gym date.

321
00:17:06,893 --> 00:17:09,262
Because I'd want to work out together.

322
00:17:09,262 --> 00:17:10,930
I could never do that.

323
00:17:10,930 --> 00:17:12,298
Why not?

324
00:17:14,767 --> 00:17:16,235
(Glances)

325
00:17:19,105 --> 00:17:20,139
Na Young.

326
00:17:21,240 --> 00:17:23,276
(Another question for Na Young)

327
00:17:23,276 --> 00:17:26,279
If the person you like...

328
00:17:31,183 --> 00:17:32,184
This is driving me crazy.

329
00:17:32,718 --> 00:17:34,787
If you thought,

330
00:17:34,787 --> 00:17:38,190
"He's not sure about me,"

331
00:17:38,190 --> 00:17:41,961
would that influence your decision?

332
00:17:44,964 --> 00:17:48,067
Does his choice influence mine?

333
00:17:49,569 --> 00:17:53,472
If he can't give you any reassurance,

334
00:17:53,472 --> 00:17:57,410
would that affect your choice?

335
00:18:00,012 --> 00:18:06,586
(Would Na Young waver
without Seon Ho's reassurance?)

336
00:18:09,155 --> 00:18:10,690
It wouldn't really matter to me.

337
00:18:15,127 --> 00:18:16,729
Your feelings matter more?

338
00:18:16,729 --> 00:18:17,663
I mean,

339
00:18:21,867 --> 00:18:25,504
whether he's sure is up to him.

340
00:18:25,504 --> 00:18:27,506
My feelings wouldn't...

341
00:18:29,141 --> 00:18:32,545
change because of that.

342
00:18:38,484 --> 00:18:43,656
(Na Young's certainty never wavers.)

343
00:18:48,227 --> 00:18:49,695
These questions are so hard.

344
00:18:55,735 --> 00:18:56,736
Na Young.

345
00:19:03,209 --> 00:19:09,048
Do you feel the same as you did yesterday
about your date?

346
00:19:11,217 --> 00:19:13,486
Should I answer yes or no?

347
00:19:13,486 --> 00:19:15,254
Whether your feelings from yesterday...

348
00:19:15,254 --> 00:19:16,155
Are the same?

349
00:19:17,723 --> 00:19:23,896
(Have Na Young's feelings grown?)

350
00:19:27,667 --> 00:19:30,336
They've grown so much stronger.

351
00:19:32,371 --> 00:19:36,943
(Na Young answers without hesitation.)

352
00:19:47,620 --> 00:19:50,389
(Looks around)

353
00:19:54,860 --> 00:19:56,562
Was I too honest?

354
00:20:06,005 --> 00:20:07,640
Hearing that...

355
00:20:07,640 --> 00:20:11,510
She was expressing how she feels
about the man I like.

356
00:20:11,510 --> 00:20:12,678
That was...

357
00:20:12,945 --> 00:20:14,647
a little uncomfortable.

358
00:20:14,647 --> 00:20:16,249
It didn't feel good.

359
00:20:19,886 --> 00:20:20,820
Na Young.

360
00:20:24,123 --> 00:20:27,727
(Ye Ji suddenly questions Na Young.)

361
00:20:29,228 --> 00:20:30,129
(Startled)

362
00:20:31,864 --> 00:20:33,866
My goodness.

363
00:20:33,866 --> 00:20:35,501
Everyone's reading the room.

364
00:20:35,501 --> 00:20:36,836
The atmosphere just changed.

365
00:20:36,836 --> 00:20:38,437
Let's go.

366
00:20:38,437 --> 00:20:39,438
Do it properly.

367
00:20:43,676 --> 00:20:45,845
You said there's someone you like.

368
00:20:47,079 --> 00:20:50,116
What do you like about him?

369
00:20:58,925 --> 00:21:00,526
(I can't watch.)

370
00:21:01,127 --> 00:21:02,194
That question...

371
00:21:07,300 --> 00:21:08,901
(Flustered)

372
00:21:09,936 --> 00:21:11,270
Honestly,

373
00:21:17,209 --> 00:21:19,312
he really isn't my type physically.

374
00:21:21,681 --> 00:21:22,548
I mean,

375
00:21:22,548 --> 00:21:24,750
we have to be honest.

376
00:21:24,750 --> 00:21:26,385
He's not my type at all.

377
00:21:26,385 --> 00:21:28,621
And I thought...

378
00:21:28,621 --> 00:21:32,558
he wasn't very manly.

379
00:21:33,192 --> 00:21:35,728
But he was more manly than I expected.

380
00:21:35,728 --> 00:21:37,930
That side of him...

381
00:21:38,965 --> 00:21:43,102
made my heart race.

382
00:21:44,370 --> 00:21:47,306
I suddenly started to like him.

383
00:21:47,306 --> 00:21:49,342
I saw many unexpected sides of him.

384
00:21:51,410 --> 00:21:56,182
(Na Young answers Ye Ji's question.)

385
00:21:58,384 --> 00:21:59,952
I have a question for Seon Ho.

386
00:22:01,487 --> 00:22:04,724
Have you made up your mind?

387
00:22:11,597 --> 00:22:17,803
(One day before the final choice,
has Seon Ho made up his mind?)

388
00:22:21,974 --> 00:22:23,676
Not completely.

389
00:22:29,448 --> 00:22:30,683
But...

390
00:22:30,683 --> 00:22:32,785
I think I'm leaning one way. And...

391
00:22:36,255 --> 00:22:38,591
(His wavering heart...)

392
00:22:38,591 --> 00:22:42,128
(begins to lean one way.)

393
00:22:42,862 --> 00:22:44,063
Can I ask a question?

394
00:22:45,097 --> 00:22:46,532
You said you're leaning one way.

395
00:22:46,532 --> 00:22:47,700
Wait, hold on.

396
00:22:50,469 --> 00:22:52,271
- You said you're leaning one way.
- Wait.

397
00:22:54,373 --> 00:22:56,175
What are the percentages?

398
00:22:59,045 --> 00:23:00,446
(Surprised)

399
00:23:00,446 --> 00:23:01,948
Good question.

400
00:23:02,915 --> 00:23:03,683
(Flinches)

401
00:23:04,617 --> 00:23:06,919
What is he going to do?

402
00:23:06,919 --> 00:23:08,554
It's the Room of Time all over again.

403
00:23:08,554 --> 00:23:10,289
Don't say 50 to 50 again.

404
00:23:10,289 --> 00:23:11,624
Give me a second.

405
00:23:12,425 --> 00:23:13,526
(Maximum tension)

406
00:23:13,526 --> 00:23:14,527
My throat is dry.

407
00:23:14,527 --> 00:23:15,361
I need some water.

408
00:23:15,361 --> 00:23:16,395
Just give us one number.

409
00:23:17,196 --> 00:23:18,664
(Tense)

410
00:23:19,298 --> 00:23:23,536
(Ye Ji's question for Seon Ho)

411
00:23:25,471 --> 00:23:27,340
(Troubled)

412
00:23:30,276 --> 00:23:37,250
(How far has Seon Ho's heart tilted?)

413
00:23:40,253 --> 00:23:41,454
Sixty to forty.

414
00:23:41,454 --> 00:23:43,723
Or perhaps 70 to 30.

415
00:23:56,569 --> 00:23:58,471
(Thinks)

416
00:24:00,406 --> 00:24:04,877
You said 40 to 60, or 30 to 70.

417
00:24:07,847 --> 00:24:12,318
But shouldn't it be at least 20 to 80?

418
00:24:15,955 --> 00:24:16,756
(Trembles)

419
00:24:16,756 --> 00:24:17,857
Exactly.

420
00:24:17,857 --> 00:24:19,392
This is so satisfying.

421
00:24:19,926 --> 00:24:21,694
Now that she thinks about it, she's mad.

422
00:24:22,828 --> 00:24:24,130
"Hold on."

423
00:24:24,130 --> 00:24:25,031
"This isn't right."

424
00:24:25,031 --> 00:24:26,432
"It really isn't."

425
00:24:28,267 --> 00:24:30,269
She's held it in. She's about to explode.

426
00:24:30,269 --> 00:24:31,470
She's about to explode.

427
00:24:31,470 --> 00:24:32,371
Seriously.

428
00:24:33,739 --> 00:24:38,578
(Can his leaning heart become certainty?)

429
00:24:41,180 --> 00:24:42,214
Is it over?

430
00:24:42,214 --> 00:24:43,149
Is that it?

431
00:24:43,549 --> 00:24:44,550
We're done.

432
00:24:44,550 --> 00:24:45,518
What?

433
00:24:46,018 --> 00:24:47,053
Why?

434
00:24:47,053 --> 00:24:48,588
What is it?

435
00:24:49,021 --> 00:24:50,156
- Check your phone.
- What is it?

436
00:24:53,559 --> 00:24:58,364
(Everyone suddenly receives a text.)

437
00:25:02,501 --> 00:25:04,003
This is too...

438
00:25:04,003 --> 00:25:05,104
Hold on.

439
00:25:08,839 --> 00:25:10,307
(Day 6)

440
00:25:10,307 --> 00:25:13,176
(We will now reveal the total time...)

441
00:25:13,176 --> 00:25:15,779
(you received from other members
over the past five days.)

442
00:25:15,779 --> 00:25:19,883
(Every night, they gave time
to reflect on how strongly they felt.)

443
00:25:19,883 --> 00:25:21,418
(Over the last five days,)

444
00:25:21,418 --> 00:25:25,756
(how much time did they exchange?)

445
00:25:27,791 --> 00:25:30,827
(Their cumulative time is revealed.)

446
00:25:30,827 --> 00:25:31,995
This is huge.

447
00:25:32,429 --> 00:25:33,764
(A lethal dose of dopamine)

448
00:25:33,764 --> 00:25:36,533
From day one through yesterday,
all five days.

449
00:25:36,533 --> 00:25:37,634
All five days.

450
00:25:37,634 --> 00:25:40,170
I can't believe they're showing this.

451
00:25:40,170 --> 00:25:41,638
Once they see it,

452
00:25:41,638 --> 00:25:42,873
everything will look different.

453
00:25:42,873 --> 00:25:44,675
Exactly. It will.

454
00:25:44,675 --> 00:25:45,842
It will all look different.

455
00:25:45,842 --> 00:25:48,378
They'll think, "Hold on."

456
00:25:48,812 --> 00:25:50,881
"You gave me this much time?"

457
00:25:50,881 --> 00:25:52,182
"And I never noticed?"

458
00:25:52,182 --> 00:25:53,417
This is unbelievable.

459
00:25:53,417 --> 00:25:54,351
I'm starting to sweat.

460
00:25:54,351 --> 00:25:55,185
This is crazy.

461
00:25:56,086 --> 00:25:56,853
No way.

462
00:25:58,689 --> 00:26:00,958
(Their cumulative time will be revealed.)

463
00:26:01,191 --> 00:26:03,293
(The women's total time
given to Kim Ryun Gi)

464
00:26:03,293 --> 00:26:05,829
(Kang Min Young - 160 minutes
Seo Ro Bin - 110 minutes)

465
00:26:05,829 --> 00:26:08,332
(Kim Na Young - 60 minutes,
Jung Ye Ji - 0 minutes)

466
00:26:08,565 --> 00:26:10,467
(The men's total time
given to Kang Min Young)

467
00:26:10,467 --> 00:26:13,437
(Kim Jong Eun - 260 minutes,
Kim Ryun Gi - 40 minutes)

468
00:26:13,437 --> 00:26:16,406
(Han Do Gon - 0 minutes,
Kim Seon Ho - 0 minutes)

469
00:26:16,640 --> 00:26:18,909
(The women's total time
given to Kim Jong Eun)

470
00:26:18,909 --> 00:26:21,712
(Seo Ro Bin - 330 minutes,
Jung Ye Ji - 40 minutes)

471
00:26:21,712 --> 00:26:24,481
(Kim Na Young - 10 minutes,
Kang Min Young - 0 minutes)

472
00:26:24,715 --> 00:26:26,650
(Han Do Gon - 480 minutes,
Kim Ryun Gi - 360 minutes)

473
00:26:26,650 --> 00:26:28,552
(Kim Seon Ho - 150 minutes,
Kim Jong Eun - 0 minutes)

474
00:26:30,520 --> 00:26:31,989
Four hundred eighty minutes.

475
00:26:31,989 --> 00:26:35,659
(Do Gon gave Ro Bin
480 of his 500 minutes.)

476
00:26:35,659 --> 00:26:37,394
Now she sees how unaware she'd been.

477
00:26:37,394 --> 00:26:39,129
This is huge.

478
00:26:39,963 --> 00:26:42,866
(The men's total time
given to Seo Ro Bin)

479
00:26:42,866 --> 00:26:47,437
(Han Do Gon - 480 minutes)

480
00:26:47,704 --> 00:26:49,439
(The women's total time
given to Han Do Gon)

481
00:26:49,439 --> 00:26:51,542
(Jung Ye Ji - 200 minutes,
Kim Na Young - 190 minutes)

482
00:26:51,542 --> 00:26:53,610
(Kang Min Young - 30 minutes,
Seo Ro Bin - 30 minutes)

483
00:26:55,479 --> 00:26:58,315
Hold on. This is too revealing.

484
00:26:58,315 --> 00:26:59,616
(Kim Seon Ho - 270 minutes,
Kim Jong Eun - 50 minutes)

485
00:26:59,616 --> 00:27:00,918
(Han Do Gon - 10 minutes,
Kim Ryun Gi - 0 minutes)

486
00:27:01,151 --> 00:27:03,720
(The women's total time
given to Kim Seon Ho)

487
00:27:03,720 --> 00:27:07,191
(Kang Min Young - 310 minutes,
Jung Ye Ji - 260 minutes)

488
00:27:07,191 --> 00:27:10,661
(Kim Na Young - 240 minutes,
Seo Ro Bin - 30 minutes)

489
00:27:10,928 --> 00:27:13,230
(The men's total time
given to Kim Na Young)

490
00:27:13,230 --> 00:27:16,500
(Kim Jong Eun - 190 minutes,
Kim Ryun Gi - 100 minutes)

491
00:27:16,500 --> 00:27:19,736
(Kim Seon Ho - 80 minutes,
Han Do Gon - 10 minutes)

492
00:27:20,604 --> 00:27:25,876
(Everyone is stunned by the totals.)

493
00:27:29,079 --> 00:27:30,814
Isn't this too much?

494
00:27:30,814 --> 00:27:32,115
Hold on.

495
00:27:32,115 --> 00:27:33,317
I'm losing my mind.

496
00:27:38,722 --> 00:27:40,357
That's less than I expected.

497
00:27:41,425 --> 00:27:42,492
(Kim Seon Ho to Kim Na Young,
80 minutes out of 500)

498
00:27:42,492 --> 00:27:43,794
Of course, it was only two days.

499
00:27:43,794 --> 00:27:46,330
I knew he hadn't chosen me before.

500
00:27:46,330 --> 00:27:48,098
We'd talked about that.

501
00:27:48,098 --> 00:27:49,399
That didn't bother me at all.

502
00:27:50,200 --> 00:27:52,302
But I expected over 100 minutes.

503
00:27:53,403 --> 00:27:55,005
Still,

504
00:27:55,005 --> 00:27:58,041
I went all in both times.

505
00:27:58,041 --> 00:27:59,243
I went straight for him.

506
00:28:00,043 --> 00:28:02,679
That took so much courage.

507
00:28:03,413 --> 00:28:04,815
Ye Ji and Seon Ho...

508
00:28:04,815 --> 00:28:06,817
were closer than I thought.

509
00:28:07,484 --> 00:28:08,852
Of course I'm jealous.

510
00:28:08,852 --> 00:28:10,254
How could I not be?

511
00:28:11,054 --> 00:28:12,623
But he said I'd shaken him.

512
00:28:12,623 --> 00:28:16,226
So our date must have been enough...

513
00:28:16,226 --> 00:28:18,762
to shake all that history.

514
00:28:21,965 --> 00:28:27,004
(The two days she spent with Seon Ho)

515
00:28:27,604 --> 00:28:28,672
I decided...

516
00:28:28,672 --> 00:28:30,974
to think only of those two days...

517
00:28:30,974 --> 00:28:33,310
the short time we'd shared.

518
00:28:35,112 --> 00:28:40,083
(She decides to trust their time.)

519
00:28:49,626 --> 00:28:51,295
Seon Ho still...

520
00:28:51,295 --> 00:28:52,663
hasn't given me...

521
00:28:52,663 --> 00:28:55,165
a clear answer.

522
00:28:55,165 --> 00:28:59,036
Still, he had shown me how he felt.

523
00:28:59,036 --> 00:29:00,871
He'd given me so much time.

524
00:29:00,871 --> 00:29:02,806
Seeing it helped ease...

525
00:29:02,806 --> 00:29:05,842
some of the hurt I'd felt.

526
00:29:05,842 --> 00:29:10,380
Maybe he was sincere about me too.

527
00:29:17,020 --> 00:29:17,921
My goodness.

528
00:29:19,556 --> 00:29:20,991
It was completely unexpected.

529
00:29:21,859 --> 00:29:24,862
Na Young gave me more than I expected.

530
00:29:25,395 --> 00:29:28,866
I didn't know her feelings were so strong.

531
00:29:28,866 --> 00:29:31,168
We'd known each other
for such a short time.

532
00:29:32,703 --> 00:29:34,438
But after seeing it,

533
00:29:34,438 --> 00:29:36,974
the two women gave similar amounts.

534
00:29:36,974 --> 00:29:38,208
That surprised me.

535
00:29:38,208 --> 00:29:39,142
(Kim Na Young to Kim Seon Ho,
240 minutes total)

536
00:29:39,142 --> 00:29:40,043
(Jung Ye Ji to Kim Seon Ho,
260 minutes total)

537
00:29:40,043 --> 00:29:44,281
(Only 20 minutes separate the two.)

538
00:29:44,548 --> 00:29:46,083
Goodness.

539
00:29:46,083 --> 00:29:48,018
If Seon Ho had seen...

540
00:29:48,018 --> 00:29:49,987
that Ye Ji had given him much more time...

541
00:29:49,987 --> 00:29:52,489
and Na Young much less,

542
00:29:52,489 --> 00:29:54,091
I think it would've influenced him.

543
00:29:54,091 --> 00:29:55,225
But they were close.

544
00:29:55,225 --> 00:29:56,460
They're so close.

545
00:29:56,460 --> 00:29:58,195
Honestly, for Seon Ho,

546
00:29:58,195 --> 00:29:59,863
it'll make his decision even harder.

547
00:29:59,863 --> 00:30:01,498
His head was already a mess.

548
00:30:01,498 --> 00:30:03,600
Now he's got even more to think about.

549
00:30:03,600 --> 00:30:04,835
It keeps piling on.

550
00:30:04,835 --> 00:30:06,537
His mind is still a mess.

551
00:30:06,537 --> 00:30:08,005
He must be agonizing over this.

552
00:30:11,942 --> 00:30:13,810
Seeing how both women felt...

553
00:30:14,611 --> 00:30:17,748
was honestly more than I could handle.

554
00:30:19,283 --> 00:30:22,252
I don't think I can talk about it now.

555
00:30:23,520 --> 00:30:24,922
Well,

556
00:30:26,390 --> 00:30:27,658
it was still hard.

557
00:30:27,891 --> 00:30:32,429
(Seon Ho grows more conflicted
after seeing the totals.)

558
00:30:33,897 --> 00:30:39,369
(Han Do Gon to Seo Ro Bin,
480 minutes out of 500)

559
00:30:40,904 --> 00:30:44,074
I was stunned when I saw it,

560
00:30:44,074 --> 00:30:47,110
but I tried not to show it.

561
00:30:48,979 --> 00:30:50,514
(Day 1)

562
00:30:51,615 --> 00:30:52,950
(Day 2)

563
00:30:53,350 --> 00:30:56,787
(Every day, his time went to Ro Bin.)

564
00:30:56,787 --> 00:30:57,888
(Day 4)

565
00:30:58,922 --> 00:31:00,357
(Day 5)

566
00:31:02,526 --> 00:31:06,897
He'd given me so much more time
than I'd expected.

567
00:31:06,897 --> 00:31:09,233
I was very surprised,

568
00:31:09,233 --> 00:31:11,235
because he already knew...

569
00:31:12,636 --> 00:31:14,204
how I felt.

570
00:31:14,204 --> 00:31:17,608
But he kept pursuing only me.

571
00:31:17,608 --> 00:31:20,344
Seeing the actual number...

572
00:31:21,979 --> 00:31:25,515
made me realize how incredible he was.

573
00:31:25,983 --> 00:31:31,388
He wanted to spend that much time with me.

574
00:31:32,222 --> 00:31:35,692
That's what it made me think.

575
00:31:36,927 --> 00:31:38,695
The depth of his feelings for me...

576
00:31:38,695 --> 00:31:41,064
felt so much more real.

577
00:31:43,200 --> 00:31:45,068
It was...

578
00:31:45,068 --> 00:31:46,169
The time...

579
00:31:46,169 --> 00:31:47,971
How should I put this?

580
00:31:47,971 --> 00:31:51,241
The warmth he showed me...

581
00:31:51,241 --> 00:31:54,845
and kept giving me...

582
00:31:54,845 --> 00:31:55,712
made me...

583
00:31:58,048 --> 00:31:59,650
waver.

584
00:32:04,454 --> 00:32:07,191
(What made Ro Bin waver...)

585
00:32:07,191 --> 00:32:10,127
(was 480 minutes of sincerity.)

586
00:32:12,062 --> 00:32:14,431
The man with eyes only for Ro Bin...

587
00:32:14,431 --> 00:32:16,934
was Do Gon, I thought.

588
00:32:16,934 --> 00:32:19,036
Because Do Gon...

589
00:32:19,036 --> 00:32:21,138
kept going straight for her.

590
00:32:21,138 --> 00:32:23,574
He was certain of his feelings,

591
00:32:23,574 --> 00:32:26,710
and never stopped pursuing her.

592
00:32:26,710 --> 00:32:29,012
So I was a little more wary of him.

593
00:32:29,012 --> 00:32:33,050
But it didn't mean much,

594
00:32:33,050 --> 00:32:34,918
because in the end,

595
00:32:34,918 --> 00:32:37,421
the 100 minutes Ro Bin gave me
and the 100 minutes I gave her...

596
00:32:37,421 --> 00:32:40,257
gave me the certainty I needed.

597
00:32:40,257 --> 00:32:42,359
It may have been what helped me...

598
00:32:42,893 --> 00:32:44,895
become sure of her feelings for me.

599
00:32:44,895 --> 00:32:50,067
(Ryun Gi's certainty
and Do Gon's sincerity)

600
00:32:50,067 --> 00:32:54,371
(Where will Ro Bin's heart go?)

601
00:33:03,380 --> 00:33:05,682
Should we take a break?

602
00:33:05,682 --> 00:33:07,351
I need one.

603
00:33:07,351 --> 00:33:08,685
I'm overloaded.

604
00:33:10,687 --> 00:33:12,055
This is exhausting.

605
00:33:12,055 --> 00:33:13,323
I'm completely drained.

606
00:33:14,725 --> 00:33:16,760
(Worn out)

607
00:33:18,161 --> 00:33:20,264
Are you okay? Seon Ho, are you okay?

608
00:33:20,264 --> 00:33:21,198
What's with his hair?

609
00:33:21,198 --> 00:33:22,499
Only Seon Ho looks serious.

610
00:33:23,834 --> 00:33:24,835
This is hilarious.

611
00:33:25,969 --> 00:33:27,704
Do Gon, can we talk?

612
00:33:27,704 --> 00:33:28,505
Where do you want to talk?

613
00:33:28,505 --> 00:33:30,307
- Where do you want to go?
- Outside.

614
00:33:32,009 --> 00:33:34,711
(After the cumulative time reveal,
Ro Bin asks Do Gon to talk.)

615
00:33:34,711 --> 00:33:35,646
How do you feel?

616
00:33:36,280 --> 00:33:37,681
It looks like Do Gon
and Ro Bin are talking.

617
00:33:37,681 --> 00:33:39,416
Good. Please talk.

618
00:33:39,416 --> 00:33:40,951
- I've been waiting for this.
- Hurry.

619
00:33:40,951 --> 00:33:42,853
- I've been waiting for this.
- Let's go.

620
00:33:42,853 --> 00:33:44,221
(Eager)

621
00:33:46,256 --> 00:33:47,524
How do you feel?

622
00:33:47,524 --> 00:33:48,458
How I feel?

623
00:33:48,458 --> 00:33:50,994
I thought...

624
00:33:50,994 --> 00:33:54,097
you might feel pressured, Ro Bin.

625
00:33:54,097 --> 00:33:57,501
But I'm always so grateful to you.

626
00:33:57,501 --> 00:33:59,102
I kept...

627
00:33:59,102 --> 00:34:01,538
talking to other people...

628
00:34:01,538 --> 00:34:03,340
and taking time to get to know them.

629
00:34:03,340 --> 00:34:04,908
But you only...

630
00:34:06,810 --> 00:34:09,713
expressed your feelings for me.

631
00:34:09,713 --> 00:34:10,914
I'm truly so grateful.

632
00:34:11,748 --> 00:34:14,618
I did it because I wanted to.

633
00:34:14,618 --> 00:34:16,019
I know.

634
00:34:16,019 --> 00:34:18,889
You're the only person...

635
00:34:18,889 --> 00:34:23,493
I've ever felt attracted to here.

636
00:34:23,493 --> 00:34:25,395
So I just...

637
00:34:25,395 --> 00:34:28,031
didn't want to give anyone else...

638
00:34:28,031 --> 00:34:31,401
false hope by giving them time.

639
00:34:31,401 --> 00:34:32,302
I see.

640
00:34:34,438 --> 00:34:36,607
That's why...

641
00:34:36,607 --> 00:34:39,776
I chose to express myself only to you.

642
00:34:40,210 --> 00:34:43,146
That's just how I felt.

643
00:34:43,146 --> 00:34:44,748
But just because I feel that way,

644
00:34:44,748 --> 00:34:47,184
I never wanted you...

645
00:34:47,184 --> 00:34:49,186
to feel any pressure because of it.

646
00:34:49,186 --> 00:34:50,520
That's how I felt.

647
00:34:53,223 --> 00:34:55,926
Then, back when...

648
00:34:55,926 --> 00:34:57,995
I'm only asking because it's in the past.

649
00:34:57,995 --> 00:35:00,163
That moment has passed.

650
00:35:00,163 --> 00:35:03,200
On our second date,

651
00:35:03,200 --> 00:35:05,836
you said you liked two men.

652
00:35:06,837 --> 00:35:08,005
Do you remember?

653
00:35:08,005 --> 00:35:08,839
Yes.

654
00:35:09,506 --> 00:35:11,441
(During their Day 3 date)

655
00:35:12,376 --> 00:35:13,844
How many men do you like right now?

656
00:35:13,844 --> 00:35:14,678
Me?

657
00:35:16,480 --> 00:35:18,181
- Two.
- Two?

658
00:35:19,883 --> 00:35:23,387
(Ro Bin's answer stayed with Do Gon.)

659
00:35:24,288 --> 00:35:25,455
Back then,

660
00:35:25,455 --> 00:35:26,990
was I already not one of them?

661
00:35:27,691 --> 00:35:29,526
Back then,

662
00:35:31,061 --> 00:35:32,429
you were one of them.

663
00:35:32,429 --> 00:35:33,297
I was one of the two?

664
00:35:33,297 --> 00:35:34,898
Yes, you were.

665
00:35:35,732 --> 00:35:38,402
(He had always wanted to know.)

666
00:35:38,402 --> 00:35:40,204
I suddenly wanted to ask.

667
00:35:40,204 --> 00:35:42,439
Thank you for bringing it up first.

668
00:35:42,439 --> 00:35:45,008
I kept thinking about when to tell you.

669
00:35:45,008 --> 00:35:48,412
I was always waiting for the right time.

670
00:35:48,412 --> 00:35:51,548
I wanted to tell you today for sure.

671
00:35:51,548 --> 00:35:53,116
So did I.

672
00:35:53,116 --> 00:35:56,820
I kept looking for the right moment too.

673
00:35:56,820 --> 00:35:58,789
I decided I had to say it.

674
00:35:59,890 --> 00:36:00,891
That's good.

675
00:36:04,061 --> 00:36:10,734
(Did his long-held feelings
reach Ro Bin's heart?)

676
00:36:12,135 --> 00:36:17,241
(Meanwhile, Ryun Gi spends time alone.)

677
00:36:22,112 --> 00:36:24,014
For me,

678
00:36:24,014 --> 00:36:26,450
I thought Ro Bin needed...

679
00:36:26,450 --> 00:36:29,720
to talk not only with Do Gon,

680
00:36:29,720 --> 00:36:32,256
but also with other people
to sort out her feelings.

681
00:36:32,256 --> 00:36:35,626
If she had become sure about me,

682
00:36:35,626 --> 00:36:40,230
I wondered if she'd thought it through.

683
00:36:42,499 --> 00:36:49,039
(What will this time mean to them?)

684
00:36:52,309 --> 00:36:56,113
(Meanwhile, Seon Ho and Jong Eun
enter the garden.)

685
00:36:56,113 --> 00:36:57,714
It's hot.

686
00:36:57,714 --> 00:36:59,182
- It's not that cold.
- Right.

687
00:37:00,717 --> 00:37:01,685
Seon Ho.

688
00:37:02,386 --> 00:37:04,388
Are you still thinking carefully?

689
00:37:05,556 --> 00:37:06,557
How do you feel?

690
00:37:06,557 --> 00:37:08,625
It's just that...

691
00:37:10,194 --> 00:37:12,796
I don't want to end up hurting anyone.

692
00:37:12,796 --> 00:37:15,666
That's made me more cautious.

693
00:37:15,666 --> 00:37:17,201
And...

694
00:37:17,201 --> 00:37:19,136
I feel so conflicted and sorry.

695
00:37:19,803 --> 00:37:20,871
But Seon Ho.

696
00:37:20,871 --> 00:37:22,973
You need to let go of that guilt.

697
00:37:22,973 --> 00:37:25,709
It doesn't matter anymore.

698
00:37:26,043 --> 00:37:27,277
It's the end.

699
00:37:27,277 --> 00:37:30,514
Feeling sorry or guilty doesn't matter.

700
00:37:30,514 --> 00:37:32,816
There's also...

701
00:37:33,750 --> 00:37:36,420
I want to make this choice carefully.

702
00:37:36,787 --> 00:37:40,190
But this is a very unusual situation.

703
00:37:40,190 --> 00:37:42,292
And we're working against a deadline.

704
00:37:42,292 --> 00:37:43,460
Right.

705
00:37:43,460 --> 00:37:44,461
Exactly.

706
00:37:46,096 --> 00:37:47,664
But I still think...

707
00:37:47,664 --> 00:37:50,067
I have until tomorrow.

708
00:37:50,067 --> 00:37:53,003
I have until the final choice.

709
00:37:53,003 --> 00:37:55,038
I want to take my time and think.

710
00:37:57,274 --> 00:38:01,678
(Seon Ho's mind is full of questions.)

711
00:38:02,412 --> 00:38:04,314
Goodness.

712
00:38:05,983 --> 00:38:07,551
(Troubled)

713
00:38:10,921 --> 00:38:16,059
(Na Young can't calm her troubled mind.)

714
00:38:18,996 --> 00:38:20,864
(Sighs)

715
00:38:23,834 --> 00:38:25,335
Gosh.

716
00:38:25,335 --> 00:38:26,503
I'm losing my mind.

717
00:38:32,109 --> 00:38:33,610
I'm so annoyed.

718
00:38:33,610 --> 00:38:34,545
My head hurts.

719
00:38:38,448 --> 00:38:41,852
(She tries to soothe herself with beer.)

720
00:38:42,686 --> 00:38:43,287
Na Young.

721
00:38:43,287 --> 00:38:44,354
Wait.

722
00:38:44,354 --> 00:38:46,256
What's wrong, Na Young?

723
00:38:46,490 --> 00:38:48,192
Why are you drinking alone?

724
00:38:48,192 --> 00:38:50,694
We were all drinking together.
Now I'm drinking alone.

725
00:38:51,261 --> 00:38:53,664
(Na Young's solitary after-party...)

726
00:38:54,965 --> 00:38:58,835
(is joined by Ro Bin and Jong Eun.)

727
00:38:59,970 --> 00:39:01,672
I really needed a drink.

728
00:39:02,506 --> 00:39:04,107
Shouldn't you be drinking soju?

729
00:39:04,107 --> 00:39:06,143
Why do you still feel unresolved
after talking?

730
00:39:06,376 --> 00:39:08,345
Did it make things more complicated?

731
00:39:08,345 --> 00:39:10,214
The truth is,

732
00:39:10,214 --> 00:39:11,548
earlier today,

733
00:39:12,216 --> 00:39:14,384
I thought he must be wavering toward me.

734
00:39:15,552 --> 00:39:16,620
I thought it must be me.

735
00:39:16,620 --> 00:39:18,188
That's what I thought.

736
00:39:18,922 --> 00:39:20,891
But then I heard him in the truth game.

737
00:39:20,891 --> 00:39:22,726
I wondered if I was wrong.

738
00:39:22,726 --> 00:39:23,760
Maybe...

739
00:39:23,760 --> 00:39:27,130
both women thrill him
and connect with him.

740
00:39:27,130 --> 00:39:28,832
I was confused.

741
00:39:28,832 --> 00:39:30,400
Then what did it all mean?

742
00:39:30,400 --> 00:39:33,437
What is he basing this on?

743
00:39:33,437 --> 00:39:34,471
I just don't know.

744
00:39:34,471 --> 00:39:37,174
I understand. He's human.
I'd feel the same.

745
00:39:37,174 --> 00:39:40,043
If I were torn between two people,

746
00:39:40,043 --> 00:39:41,678
I'd understand.

747
00:39:41,678 --> 00:39:43,247
But from my perspective,

748
00:39:43,247 --> 00:39:45,349
I have no idea what he means.

749
00:39:47,351 --> 00:39:49,152
Tomorrow is the final day.

750
00:39:49,987 --> 00:39:51,622
What am I supposed to do?

751
00:39:53,690 --> 00:39:56,026
I'm really losing my mind.

752
00:39:56,026 --> 00:39:58,762
And he...

753
00:39:58,762 --> 00:40:00,097
looked so restless.

754
00:40:00,097 --> 00:40:02,299
I could see how hard this was for him.

755
00:40:02,299 --> 00:40:03,934
So I couldn't say anything to him.

756
00:40:03,934 --> 00:40:05,469
I just said, "I understand."

757
00:40:08,005 --> 00:40:09,506
But I'm losing my mind.

758
00:40:09,506 --> 00:40:11,208
What am I supposed to do?

759
00:40:12,109 --> 00:40:13,310
Seon Ho must have a lot on his mind.

760
00:40:13,310 --> 00:40:14,444
But Seon Ho...

761
00:40:16,980 --> 00:40:21,685
(A night of confusion
over Seon Ho's unreadable heart)

762
00:40:22,853 --> 00:40:24,321
This is the worst.

763
00:40:26,423 --> 00:40:27,791
Right now,

764
00:40:29,993 --> 00:40:32,896
I've never felt more confused.

765
00:40:33,397 --> 00:40:34,431
So...

766
00:40:34,431 --> 00:40:37,801
I felt that we needed to talk.

767
00:40:38,969 --> 00:40:41,605
I was desperate for any sign from him.

768
00:40:43,941 --> 00:40:45,342
(Looks around)

769
00:40:46,543 --> 00:40:47,578
Seon Ho's here.

770
00:40:47,578 --> 00:40:48,979
- What?
- Seon Ho's here.

771
00:40:50,314 --> 00:40:53,951
(Na Young finally asks Seon Ho to talk.)

772
00:40:54,818 --> 00:40:56,053
(Startled)

773
00:40:56,887 --> 00:40:57,788
Are you asleep?

774
00:40:59,489 --> 00:41:00,290
Are you asleep?

775
00:41:00,290 --> 00:41:01,592
No.

776
00:41:01,592 --> 00:41:03,293
- Do you want to be alone?
- What?

777
00:41:03,293 --> 00:41:04,928
Do you want to be alone? Or...

778
00:41:04,928 --> 00:41:06,530
No. Let's talk.

779
00:41:09,166 --> 00:41:11,235
Have you sat on the first-floor terrace?

780
00:41:11,235 --> 00:41:12,669
Yes. Let's talk there.

781
00:41:18,742 --> 00:41:20,177
I've never sat here before.

782
00:41:20,177 --> 00:41:20,978
Really?

783
00:41:20,978 --> 00:41:22,145
I haven't sat here much either.

784
00:41:22,145 --> 00:41:24,114
Jong Eun likes this spot.

785
00:41:24,114 --> 00:41:26,049
So this is the spot.

786
00:41:26,049 --> 00:41:26,917
It's nice.

787
00:41:26,917 --> 00:41:30,120
(They sit in a corner of the garden.)

788
00:41:37,294 --> 00:41:42,432
(Complex feelings fill the silence.)

789
00:41:44,368 --> 00:41:46,436
(Meanwhile)

790
00:41:47,304 --> 00:41:48,338
(Sighs)

791
00:41:48,672 --> 00:41:49,573
But...

792
00:41:50,374 --> 00:41:51,742
earlier,

793
00:41:52,776 --> 00:41:55,679
I really couldn't understand his answers.

794
00:41:55,679 --> 00:41:57,047
His answers.

795
00:41:57,047 --> 00:41:57,881
They were all so vague.

796
00:41:57,881 --> 00:41:59,082
Every single answer.

797
00:41:59,917 --> 00:42:00,817
It was...

798
00:42:00,817 --> 00:42:02,619
I was so disappointed too.

799
00:42:03,520 --> 00:42:05,389
I was disappointed listening to them too.

800
00:42:05,389 --> 00:42:08,425
It felt like the game ended
without giving you anything.

801
00:42:08,425 --> 00:42:09,326
Exactly.

802
00:42:09,326 --> 00:42:12,162
I wanted to say,
"Why are you confusing us?"

803
00:42:12,162 --> 00:42:14,531
- Really?
- Yes,

804
00:42:14,531 --> 00:42:17,768
but that sounded too aggressive,
so I softened it.

805
00:42:17,768 --> 00:42:19,703
"Shouldn't it be at least 20 to 80?"

806
00:42:19,703 --> 00:42:20,637
Exactly.

807
00:42:20,637 --> 00:42:23,240
Since it's so short, feelings change fast.

808
00:42:23,240 --> 00:42:24,508
Exactly.

809
00:42:24,508 --> 00:42:26,210
Everything moves so fast here.

810
00:42:26,210 --> 00:42:27,344
Every day is different.

811
00:42:29,613 --> 00:42:30,814
Everyone's exhausted.

812
00:42:30,814 --> 00:42:33,016
Na Young and Ye Ji...

813
00:42:33,016 --> 00:42:34,618
- feel exactly the same.
- Right.

814
00:42:34,618 --> 00:42:36,486
How can they both feel the same way?

815
00:42:36,486 --> 00:42:37,955
They're both losing their minds.

816
00:42:37,955 --> 00:42:39,456
He drives them both crazy.

817
00:42:39,456 --> 00:42:40,958
It's because of the truth game.

818
00:42:41,325 --> 00:42:42,593
During the game,

819
00:42:42,593 --> 00:42:44,228
he should've answered,

820
00:42:44,228 --> 00:42:46,163
"Could it be me?"

821
00:42:46,163 --> 00:42:47,664
But everything he said was too vague.

822
00:42:48,799 --> 00:42:49,867
This is driving me crazy.

823
00:42:50,934 --> 00:42:51,902
Goodness.

824
00:42:54,037 --> 00:42:55,706
It was so hard to understand.

825
00:42:57,407 --> 00:42:58,408
But this...

826
00:43:00,611 --> 00:43:01,511
is hard.

827
00:43:05,315 --> 00:43:06,617
Of course.

828
00:43:06,617 --> 00:43:07,985
This must be hardest for you.

829
00:43:11,121 --> 00:43:13,357
(Sighs)

830
00:43:14,324 --> 00:43:16,527
(Thinks)

831
00:43:20,030 --> 00:43:21,632
But this is really difficult.

832
00:43:22,266 --> 00:43:24,668
It's harder than I thought.

833
00:43:29,973 --> 00:43:32,509
I can't speak freely in front of everyone.

834
00:43:34,278 --> 00:43:35,679
The truth is,

835
00:43:37,614 --> 00:43:39,316
there are two people on my mind too,

836
00:43:39,816 --> 00:43:42,352
if we define it that way.

837
00:43:43,687 --> 00:43:44,821
Two?

838
00:43:44,821 --> 00:43:46,723
I mean,

839
00:43:46,723 --> 00:43:49,059
one man and one woman, of course.

840
00:43:49,059 --> 00:43:50,527
The people on my mind.

841
00:43:52,095 --> 00:43:52,930
What does that mean?

842
00:43:52,930 --> 00:43:53,864
It's you...

843
00:43:53,864 --> 00:43:55,832
and Ye Ji.

844
00:43:55,832 --> 00:43:57,935
Right.

845
00:44:02,506 --> 00:44:07,544
(Na Young has Ye Ji and Seon Ho
on her mind.)

846
00:44:15,752 --> 00:44:17,154
But it's not a hard choice, is it?

847
00:44:17,154 --> 00:44:18,555
You said...

848
00:44:18,555 --> 00:44:21,325
you're leaning more toward one person.

849
00:44:21,325 --> 00:44:23,827
Whether it's 60 to 40 or 70 to 30,

850
00:44:30,534 --> 00:44:31,668
why are you still agonizing?

851
00:44:32,636 --> 00:44:35,472
But I said that, in real time,

852
00:44:35,472 --> 00:44:37,574
I keep asking myself questions.

853
00:44:37,574 --> 00:44:38,809
And your feelings keep changing?

854
00:44:38,809 --> 00:44:40,944
Yes, I keep...

855
00:44:40,944 --> 00:44:43,780
doing that.

856
00:44:43,780 --> 00:44:45,916
Just like I said, I'm still doing that.

857
00:44:47,885 --> 00:44:49,720
And I thought...

858
00:44:49,720 --> 00:44:52,256
I'd keep talking to people tonight.

859
00:44:58,195 --> 00:45:02,466
So tonight's talks may change things.

860
00:45:02,466 --> 00:45:03,967
They could.

861
00:45:07,871 --> 00:45:09,339
(Glares)

862
00:45:09,339 --> 00:45:12,209
He changes his mind
more than I change dinner plans.

863
00:45:12,209 --> 00:45:14,845
Earlier, I was seriously...

864
00:45:14,845 --> 00:45:16,980
(Ye Na explodes.)

865
00:45:17,214 --> 00:45:18,148
Hold on.

866
00:45:19,016 --> 00:45:20,384
Now I'm furious.

867
00:45:23,587 --> 00:45:24,388
(Calming down)

868
00:45:24,388 --> 00:45:27,558
Don't film this.

869
00:45:27,558 --> 00:45:29,626
Yes, boss. She's composing herself.

870
00:45:29,626 --> 00:45:31,261
Don't worry, boss.

871
00:45:31,762 --> 00:45:34,331
Can someone's feelings change this much?

872
00:45:34,331 --> 00:45:36,333
He just means, "I haven't decided yet."

873
00:45:36,333 --> 00:45:38,635
But there is hardly any time left.

874
00:45:38,635 --> 00:45:39,336
There isn't.

875
00:45:39,336 --> 00:45:42,005
Today's nearly over. There's no time left.

876
00:45:42,005 --> 00:45:43,407
He has to decide now.

877
00:45:43,407 --> 00:45:46,109
Seon Ho is saying,
"It isn't over until it's over."

878
00:45:46,443 --> 00:45:47,611
That's what it is.

879
00:45:47,611 --> 00:45:49,913
Na Young is...

880
00:45:49,913 --> 00:45:51,915
holding so much back right now.

881
00:45:51,915 --> 00:45:53,650
And you're holding so much back too.

882
00:45:53,650 --> 00:45:55,519
(Loses it)

883
00:45:59,122 --> 00:46:01,091
I just...

884
00:46:01,091 --> 00:46:05,462
Was the evening date so exciting...

885
00:46:05,462 --> 00:46:09,099
that it only shook you in the moment?

886
00:46:10,033 --> 00:46:11,735
I keep wondering that.

887
00:46:16,506 --> 00:46:21,011
(Was it a new thrill?)

888
00:46:21,011 --> 00:46:26,183
(Or a momentary attraction?)

889
00:46:29,686 --> 00:46:31,688
To me,

890
00:46:31,688 --> 00:46:34,258
words carry weight.

891
00:46:34,258 --> 00:46:37,160
You can't take back what you've said.

892
00:46:37,160 --> 00:46:38,195
That's true.

893
00:46:38,829 --> 00:46:41,031
So I'm sorry,

894
00:46:42,232 --> 00:46:45,669
but I want to think
until the final choice.

895
00:46:49,573 --> 00:46:50,541
Okay.

896
00:46:50,541 --> 00:46:53,110
Those are Seon Ho's thoughts.

897
00:46:53,110 --> 00:46:55,812
- I respect that.
- I truly respect it.

898
00:46:55,812 --> 00:46:57,281
I'd rather he told me plainly like that.

899
00:46:57,281 --> 00:47:00,017
As a fellow INFP,
how would you distance yourself?

900
00:47:00,284 --> 00:47:01,718
I'm going to change my MBTI.

901
00:47:01,718 --> 00:47:03,687
(Avoiding the avoidant)

902
00:47:03,687 --> 00:47:04,988
But hold on.

903
00:47:04,988 --> 00:47:06,723
Before the final choice,

904
00:47:06,723 --> 00:47:08,692
he'll give them some indication, right?

905
00:47:08,692 --> 00:47:10,761
- Seon Ho?
- Yes. At least.

906
00:47:10,761 --> 00:47:11,995
I don't think he will.

907
00:47:12,296 --> 00:47:14,765
Seon Ho will probably reveal it
only through the result.

908
00:47:14,765 --> 00:47:15,566
Fine.

909
00:47:15,566 --> 00:47:16,800
"Fine."

910
00:47:16,800 --> 00:47:17,768
That's funny.

911
00:47:17,768 --> 00:47:20,204
He'll probably deliberate
until the moment he chooses.

912
00:47:20,504 --> 00:47:21,605
(Agrees)

913
00:47:21,605 --> 00:47:23,307
Don't count Love Against Time out.

914
00:47:23,307 --> 00:47:25,175
We have to watch until the end.

915
00:47:25,175 --> 00:47:26,777
Even we don't know until the very end.

916
00:47:26,977 --> 00:47:29,246
This isn't something we can judge easily.

917
00:47:29,246 --> 00:47:30,414
That's not what this show is.

918
00:47:33,283 --> 00:47:34,751
This is so hard. I don't know.

919
00:47:36,587 --> 00:47:38,589
- The more you hear, the harder it is.
- Yes.

920
00:47:38,589 --> 00:47:39,590
I feel the same.

921
00:47:39,590 --> 00:47:43,227
(They never hear a clear answer.)

922
00:47:46,029 --> 00:47:51,869
(One day before the final choice,
the sleepless night deepens.)

923
00:47:52,903 --> 00:47:58,809
(The final morning finally dawns.)

924
00:48:09,486 --> 00:48:13,957
(Na Young enters the playroom alone.)

925
00:48:17,361 --> 00:48:19,463
(Thinks)

926
00:48:21,965 --> 00:48:26,970
(One thought will not leave Na Young.)

927
00:48:30,173 --> 00:48:31,608
- You know what I mean?
- Yeah.

928
00:48:31,608 --> 00:48:36,380
(Unforgettable moments with Seon Ho)

929
00:48:44,955 --> 00:48:45,822
Honestly,

930
00:48:45,822 --> 00:48:47,524
I didn't sleep.

931
00:48:47,524 --> 00:48:48,859
It felt surreal.

932
00:48:48,859 --> 00:48:51,028
I wondered why I was acting this way.

933
00:48:51,495 --> 00:48:55,499
Though he couldn't tell me directly,

934
00:48:55,499 --> 00:48:56,366
I trust him.

935
00:48:56,366 --> 00:48:58,068
We were clearly drawn to each other.

936
00:48:58,068 --> 00:49:00,037
That's why Seon Ho wavered, right?

937
00:49:01,605 --> 00:49:03,807
I want to be his first choice.

938
00:49:07,444 --> 00:49:09,179
(Sighs)

939
00:49:12,416 --> 00:49:14,585
Have you sorted out your feelings?

940
00:49:16,453 --> 00:49:17,854
This weighs on me.

941
00:49:17,854 --> 00:49:18,856
Of course it does.

942
00:49:19,890 --> 00:49:21,158
Until the very end,

943
00:49:22,860 --> 00:49:25,596
we still won't know.

944
00:49:26,697 --> 00:49:30,067
There's really nothing I can do.

945
00:49:32,369 --> 00:49:34,905
Anxiety and fear.

946
00:49:34,905 --> 00:49:36,640
I had every thought imaginable...

947
00:49:36,640 --> 00:49:38,408
in that moment.

948
00:49:39,309 --> 00:49:43,480
I realized I truly had no idea.

949
00:49:43,480 --> 00:49:45,482
Honestly, I wasn't completely certain.

950
00:49:45,482 --> 00:49:47,584
So...

951
00:49:48,051 --> 00:49:50,721
it was just hard, honestly.

952
00:49:58,028 --> 00:50:02,499
(Meanwhile, Seon Ho is lost in thought.)

953
00:50:03,800 --> 00:50:05,903
(Troubled)

954
00:50:14,044 --> 00:50:19,049
(The final choice draws closer.)

955
00:50:21,318 --> 00:50:23,220
The pictures we took.

956
00:50:24,555 --> 00:50:29,059
(Do Gon looks at their photos
from the past week.)

957
00:50:33,363 --> 00:50:35,499
(Pauses)

958
00:50:35,499 --> 00:50:37,701
Doesn't she look so carefree?

959
00:50:39,670 --> 00:50:41,438
- She does.
- Is that Dongmyo?

960
00:50:41,438 --> 00:50:45,909
It's the Sinseol-dong furniture district
below Dongmyo.

961
00:50:48,812 --> 00:50:54,284
(Carefree Ro Bin on their first date)

962
00:50:55,152 --> 00:50:57,221
This one is really,

963
00:50:57,221 --> 00:50:58,722
you know,

964
00:50:58,722 --> 00:50:59,990
the perfect girlfriend shot.

965
00:50:59,990 --> 00:51:01,091
It really is.

966
00:51:06,363 --> 00:51:11,201
(Do Gon studies Ro Bin's photos
for a long time.)

967
00:51:13,270 --> 00:51:14,238
I...

968
00:51:17,908 --> 00:51:20,277
don't know. I suddenly feel uneasy.

969
00:51:22,112 --> 00:51:23,714
(Glances)

970
00:51:23,981 --> 00:51:25,983
Honestly,

971
00:51:27,885 --> 00:51:29,853
Do Gon is an incredible man.

972
00:51:29,853 --> 00:51:31,321
- As a person, he's incredible.
- He is.

973
00:51:31,321 --> 00:51:32,756
As a person...

974
00:51:32,756 --> 00:51:33,957
He's amazing.

975
00:51:35,392 --> 00:51:40,163
He's the perfect example
of a mature, admirable man.

976
00:51:41,698 --> 00:51:46,670
(The time Do Gon gave her
keeps coming to mind.)

977
00:51:49,873 --> 00:51:52,509
Even though my heart was already sure,

978
00:51:52,910 --> 00:51:54,745
somehow,

979
00:51:54,745 --> 00:51:57,347
I think I gradually became nervous.

980
00:51:58,916 --> 00:52:00,884
No one knows what will happen.

981
00:52:01,251 --> 00:52:04,421
So I became more nervous...

982
00:52:04,421 --> 00:52:05,556
and tried to prepare myself.

983
00:52:08,792 --> 00:52:13,230
(The final bell rings in the House.)

984
00:52:14,398 --> 00:52:17,334
(Day 7, today is the final choice.)

985
00:52:17,334 --> 00:52:20,204
(The Room of Time opens now
for the final choice.)

986
00:52:20,871 --> 00:52:23,540
(The time for the final choice)

987
00:52:23,540 --> 00:52:25,075
It's time for final choices.

988
00:52:25,075 --> 00:52:26,810
- This is crazy.
- What do we do?

989
00:52:26,810 --> 00:52:29,513
I don't know. I'll be happy either way.

990
00:52:29,513 --> 00:52:30,614
Me too.

991
00:52:30,614 --> 00:52:32,883
At least one couple will...

992
00:52:32,883 --> 00:52:34,551
- end up together.
- Right.

993
00:52:34,551 --> 00:52:35,886
Here it comes.

994
00:52:35,886 --> 00:52:37,721
(Eager)

995
00:52:40,090 --> 00:52:43,160
(The final Room of Time opens.)

996
00:52:51,068 --> 00:52:54,805
(Four names)

997
00:52:54,805 --> 00:52:59,676
(One piece of time)

998
00:52:59,676 --> 00:53:05,649
(Kang Min Young, Kim Na Young,
Jung Ye Ji, Seo Ro Bin)

999
00:53:05,649 --> 00:53:08,218
(Beside the name of the person
you want to share your time with,)

1000
00:53:08,218 --> 00:53:10,454
(place your final piece.)

1001
00:53:17,294 --> 00:53:23,200
(The final choices begin now.)

1002
00:53:23,834 --> 00:53:27,871
(Do Gon enters the Room of Time
for the last time.)

1003
00:53:31,241 --> 00:53:33,310
I've given all my time...

1004
00:53:33,310 --> 00:53:35,646
to one person.

1005
00:53:37,481 --> 00:53:40,784
I decided to give her my final time too.

1006
00:53:42,052 --> 00:53:44,421
That's how I made my final choice.

1007
00:53:48,825 --> 00:53:52,696
(Do Gon - Final Choice - Ro Bin)

1008
00:53:55,899 --> 00:54:01,271
(All of Do Gon's time
goes to Ro Bin until the end.)

1009
00:54:05,709 --> 00:54:08,612
(Ryun Gi enters the Room of Time next.)

1010
00:54:09,179 --> 00:54:12,282
(Ryun Gi chooses without hesitation.)

1011
00:54:13,550 --> 00:54:17,721
(Ryun Gi - Final Choice - Ro Bin)

1012
00:54:17,721 --> 00:54:20,057
I was 100 percent certain.

1013
00:54:20,057 --> 00:54:23,994
I decided I had nothing left to consider.

1014
00:54:23,994 --> 00:54:26,897
She's someone I want to keep knowing.

1015
00:54:28,565 --> 00:54:32,970
(Two men choose Ro Bin.)

1016
00:54:35,739 --> 00:54:39,877
(Which man will Ro Bin choose?)

1017
00:54:48,852 --> 00:54:50,821
I thought a lot.

1018
00:54:52,322 --> 00:54:55,092
I realized that I gravitate toward...

1019
00:54:55,092 --> 00:54:57,427
people who express their feelings to me.

1020
00:54:59,263 --> 00:55:01,698
(Ro Bin sees...)

1021
00:55:01,698 --> 00:55:03,433
(the names of two men.)

1022
00:55:03,433 --> 00:55:06,069
Ryun Gi always expressed his feelings.

1023
00:55:06,570 --> 00:55:09,373
When I was wondering
whether to keep showing Jong Eun...

1024
00:55:09,373 --> 00:55:10,974
how I felt,

1025
00:55:12,976 --> 00:55:16,847
Ryun Gi honestly and actively
expressed himself to me.

1026
00:55:16,847 --> 00:55:19,816
So he came to mind first.

1027
00:55:21,919 --> 00:55:23,287
It's just...

1028
00:55:23,287 --> 00:55:24,755
But I...

1029
00:55:25,155 --> 00:55:27,691
(Last night)

1030
00:55:28,225 --> 00:55:31,595
(The men's total time given to Seo Ro Bin)

1031
00:55:31,595 --> 00:55:36,300
(Han Do Gon - 480 minutes,
Kim Ryun Gi - 360 minutes)

1032
00:55:36,300 --> 00:55:38,402
How do I put this?

1033
00:55:39,937 --> 00:55:42,372
Part of me was very surprised.

1034
00:55:44,408 --> 00:55:45,809
Do Gon had always...

1035
00:55:45,809 --> 00:55:47,611
expressed his feelings to me.

1036
00:55:48,812 --> 00:55:52,449
All the time he gave me shook me too.

1037
00:55:53,183 --> 00:55:55,886
I was confused.

1038
00:55:56,620 --> 00:55:59,223
I had more and more to think about.

1039
00:56:05,796 --> 00:56:07,898
(After much deliberation)

1040
00:56:07,898 --> 00:56:11,869
(The one person Ro Bin chooses)

1041
00:56:13,036 --> 00:56:14,872
- Stop. Hold on.
- Stop.

1042
00:56:15,672 --> 00:56:17,908
I'm sorry.

1043
00:56:18,642 --> 00:56:19,576
Wait.

1044
00:56:19,576 --> 00:56:20,611
Wait.

1045
00:56:20,611 --> 00:56:21,945
Didn't Ro Bin...

1046
00:56:21,945 --> 00:56:24,281
say that all the time Do Gon gave her...

1047
00:56:24,281 --> 00:56:26,049
had made her waver?

1048
00:56:26,049 --> 00:56:27,584
He spent so much time on her.

1049
00:56:27,584 --> 00:56:30,254
She must have felt very sorry...

1050
00:56:30,254 --> 00:56:32,256
and touched at the same time.

1051
00:56:32,256 --> 00:56:33,323
That will influence her.

1052
00:56:33,323 --> 00:56:34,258
I think it will.

1053
00:56:34,258 --> 00:56:35,826
Who is it?

1054
00:56:35,826 --> 00:56:36,860
I want to know.

1055
00:56:36,860 --> 00:56:40,898
(Who receives Ro Bin's final time?)

1056
00:56:43,066 --> 00:56:49,239
(What is Min Young's final choice?)

1057
00:56:50,440 --> 00:56:52,609
Instead of hoping he'd choose me,

1058
00:56:52,609 --> 00:56:55,479
I focused on my feelings when choosing.

1059
00:56:59,850 --> 00:57:04,321
(Min Young - Final Choice - Seon Ho)

1060
00:57:07,424 --> 00:57:12,095
I regret not expressing myself more.

1061
00:57:12,095 --> 00:57:15,432
I had such mixed feelings.

1062
00:57:15,432 --> 00:57:17,601
It felt bittersweet.

1063
00:57:17,601 --> 00:57:19,670
And I had regrets.

1064
00:57:21,705 --> 00:57:26,443
(Jong Eun - Final Choice - Na Young)

1065
00:57:31,848 --> 00:57:36,853
(Who receives Na Young's final time?)

1066
00:57:37,421 --> 00:57:40,457
As soon as I entered,

1067
00:57:40,457 --> 00:57:41,925
I could only see one name.

1068
00:57:42,559 --> 00:57:45,495
It was strange.

1069
00:57:45,495 --> 00:57:48,832
When I thought of the name "Seon Ho"...

1070
00:57:48,832 --> 00:57:50,334
or pictured his face,

1071
00:57:50,334 --> 00:57:52,102
I couldn't stop smiling.

1072
00:57:53,604 --> 00:57:55,105
I just...

1073
00:57:57,474 --> 00:57:59,309
found myself funny.

1074
00:58:00,210 --> 00:58:01,511
I was being ridiculous.

1075
00:58:03,347 --> 00:58:05,215
A man who makes my heart race.

1076
00:58:05,215 --> 00:58:06,183
I admit it.

1077
00:58:07,384 --> 00:58:11,455
He's that charming.

1078
00:58:17,928 --> 00:58:22,633
(Na Young - Final Choice - Seon Ho)

1079
00:58:26,904 --> 00:58:32,709
(Another woman chooses Seon Ho.)

1080
00:58:39,049 --> 00:58:42,586
I've spent so much time with Seon Ho.

1081
00:58:42,886 --> 00:58:45,756
I thought he might choose me.

1082
00:58:45,756 --> 00:58:49,760
I thought he'd give me his final time,

1083
00:58:51,195 --> 00:58:54,264
because of all the time we'd shared.

1084
00:58:54,831 --> 00:58:59,603
(Ye Ji - Final Choice - Seon Ho)

1085
00:59:05,042 --> 00:59:09,446
(Finally, Seon Ho makes his choice.)

1086
00:59:15,285 --> 00:59:17,721
(Beside the name of the person
you want to share your time with,)

1087
00:59:17,721 --> 00:59:20,390
(place your final piece.)

1088
00:59:25,863 --> 00:59:30,801
(The moment of choice finally arrives.)

1089
00:59:33,170 --> 00:59:38,008
(A single piece lies before Seon Ho.)

1090
00:59:44,581 --> 00:59:48,485
(Kim Na Young)

1091
00:59:49,086 --> 00:59:53,957
(Two women at the end of his gaze)

1092
00:59:56,360 --> 00:59:59,263
(Jung Ye Ji)

1093
01:00:08,005 --> 01:00:10,474
She was someone...

1094
01:00:10,474 --> 01:00:12,809
worth thinking about for so long.

1095
01:00:12,809 --> 01:00:15,612
She meant...

1096
01:00:15,612 --> 01:00:17,948
that much to me.

1097
01:00:27,658 --> 01:00:32,696
(One woman inspired certainty
after a long deliberation.)

1098
01:00:41,071 --> 01:00:45,742
(Who receives Seon Ho's final time?)

1099
01:00:45,742 --> 01:00:47,077
(I'm losing it.)

1100
01:00:47,444 --> 01:00:48,579
- Please.
- Hurry.

1101
01:00:48,579 --> 01:00:49,580
Seriously.

1102
01:00:49,580 --> 01:00:50,948
Hold on.

1103
01:00:51,648 --> 01:00:53,684
No matter who it is, let's celebrate them.

1104
01:00:53,684 --> 01:00:55,752
- Let's congratulate them.
- Of course.

1105
01:00:55,752 --> 01:00:57,955
Let's agree on that.

1106
01:00:57,955 --> 01:00:59,723
We have to celebrate them either way.

1107
01:00:59,723 --> 01:01:00,691
Absolutely.

1108
01:01:00,691 --> 01:01:01,692
Let's celebrate them.

1109
01:01:04,795 --> 01:01:08,031
(The final Room of Time closes.)

1110
01:01:09,333 --> 01:01:12,236
(Before they knew it,)

1111
01:01:12,236 --> 01:01:16,607
(seven days had passed.)

1112
01:01:18,775 --> 01:01:22,980
(New feelings...)

1113
01:01:22,980 --> 01:01:26,817
(and a reality they feared...)

1114
01:01:27,951 --> 01:01:31,688
(made their hearts feel certain...)

1115
01:01:31,688 --> 01:01:37,461
(and confused.)

1116
01:01:39,496 --> 01:01:42,633
(For one week, they focused entirely...)

1117
01:01:42,633 --> 01:01:46,036
(on the emotion called love.)

1118
01:01:47,471 --> 01:01:52,142
(Will their time continue together?)

1119
01:01:54,811 --> 01:02:01,785
(The final choice results are revealed.)

1120
01:02:10,227 --> 01:02:13,797
(Love Against Time begins in 10 minutes.)

1121
01:02:13,797 --> 01:02:18,335
(If your match does not arrive
in 10 minutes, please leave.)

1122
01:02:25,042 --> 01:02:26,710
What if...

1123
01:02:26,710 --> 01:02:27,844
a future I never imagined...

1124
01:02:27,844 --> 01:02:29,580
unfolds before me?

1125
01:02:29,580 --> 01:02:30,847
I think I was nervous.

1126
01:02:31,348 --> 01:02:33,517
What if I was certain,

1127
01:02:33,517 --> 01:02:35,786
but she chose someone else?

1128
01:02:35,786 --> 01:02:38,488
I honestly don't want to imagine the end.

1129
01:02:38,488 --> 01:02:39,990
Over the past week,

1130
01:02:39,990 --> 01:02:43,861
I gave her all my time without hesitation.

1131
01:02:44,828 --> 01:02:48,165
I want to give her everything I have.

1132
01:02:51,902 --> 01:02:55,005
(Chosen by both Do Gon and Ryun Gi,)

1133
01:02:55,005 --> 01:02:58,342
(where is Ro Bin headed?)

1134
01:02:59,243 --> 01:03:00,611
I was so excited.

1135
01:03:00,611 --> 01:03:01,511
And...

1136
01:03:01,778 --> 01:03:05,182
whether he would be there,

1137
01:03:05,182 --> 01:03:07,384
no matter what happened,

1138
01:03:07,384 --> 01:03:09,386
I knew I could make a choice
I'd never regret...

1139
01:03:11,321 --> 01:03:14,658
and feel certain about it.

1140
01:03:28,438 --> 01:03:33,544
He always puts others before himself.

1141
01:03:33,544 --> 01:03:36,346
He never comes first.

1142
01:03:36,346 --> 01:03:40,684
He always considers others' feelings.

1143
01:03:41,385 --> 01:03:44,254
That showed me how warm he is.

1144
01:03:53,330 --> 01:03:59,369
(He always put Ro Bin before himself.)

1145
01:04:01,438 --> 01:04:05,042
(Ro Bin's steps lead toward him.)

1146
01:04:18,121 --> 01:04:19,923
(As time runs out,)

1147
01:04:19,923 --> 01:04:23,193
(their anxiety grows.)

1148
01:04:26,096 --> 01:04:28,565
There was a high hill.

1149
01:04:28,565 --> 01:04:31,568
As I walked up that hill,

1150
01:04:31,568 --> 01:04:35,005
I saw a familiar silhouette
in the distance.

1151
01:04:37,374 --> 01:04:39,076
I was stunned.

1152
01:04:39,076 --> 01:04:41,745
Right after the surprise,

1153
01:04:41,745 --> 01:04:43,180
excitement...

1154
01:04:44,114 --> 01:04:45,749
came rushing over me.

1155
01:05:02,466 --> 01:05:03,267
Hi.

1156
01:05:06,637 --> 01:05:07,437
Hi.

1157
01:05:14,211 --> 01:05:15,445
(Surprised)

1158
01:05:17,748 --> 01:05:19,016
Who is it?

1159
01:05:19,016 --> 01:05:19,816
Hold on.

1160
01:05:22,719 --> 01:05:23,520
Hi.

1161
01:05:26,290 --> 01:05:29,927
I think I said, "Hi."

1162
01:05:29,927 --> 01:05:31,962
The moment...

1163
01:05:32,329 --> 01:05:34,831
our eyes met,

1164
01:05:37,768 --> 01:05:40,137
I still can't forget it.

1165
01:05:47,177 --> 01:05:47,911
Hi.

1166
01:05:51,982 --> 01:05:53,083
Hey.

1167
01:05:55,152 --> 01:05:59,656
(Final Choice, Kim Ryun Gi and Seo Ro Bin)

1168
01:06:01,124 --> 01:06:03,193
(Congratulations)

1169
01:06:03,193 --> 01:06:04,494
Ro Bin and Ryun Gi.

1170
01:06:05,195 --> 01:06:06,697
Congratulations.

1171
01:06:08,265 --> 01:06:09,733
- I'm so happy for them.
- Me too.

1172
01:06:09,733 --> 01:06:10,567
Unbelievable.

1173
01:06:10,567 --> 01:06:13,170
Congratulations, Ryun Gi and Ro Bin.

1174
01:06:13,170 --> 01:06:14,471
- This is incredible.
- It really happened.

1175
01:06:16,173 --> 01:06:17,107
Hold on.

1176
01:06:17,741 --> 01:06:18,742
I'm so embarrassed.

1177
01:06:23,080 --> 01:06:23,981
Hi.

1178
01:06:23,981 --> 01:06:24,882
Hello.

1179
01:06:25,649 --> 01:06:27,317
I waited so long.

1180
01:06:27,317 --> 01:06:29,286
So did I.

1181
01:06:29,286 --> 01:06:31,588
I waited a really long time too.

1182
01:06:32,623 --> 01:06:34,825
Did you expect it?

1183
01:06:36,126 --> 01:06:37,060
Thank you.

1184
01:06:37,394 --> 01:06:40,130
(They hold hands for the first time.)

1185
01:06:40,130 --> 01:06:41,532
- Did I expect it?
- Where are we going?

1186
01:06:41,932 --> 01:06:43,467
(Thrilled)

1187
01:06:45,636 --> 01:06:46,770
What?

1188
01:06:47,170 --> 01:06:48,138
Ro Bin.

1189
01:06:48,138 --> 01:06:49,206
What was that?

1190
01:06:50,040 --> 01:06:51,141
Hold on.

1191
01:06:51,141 --> 01:06:52,309
Why so fast?

1192
01:06:52,309 --> 01:06:53,443
This is incredible.

1193
01:06:53,443 --> 01:06:54,811
This is beautiful.

1194
01:06:55,012 --> 01:06:56,613
I thought my heart would burst.

1195
01:06:57,114 --> 01:06:59,383
I'm not going anywhere.
I'm just saying thank you.

1196
01:06:59,383 --> 01:07:00,551
Thank you too.

1197
01:07:00,551 --> 01:07:02,286
But your hand is freezing.

1198
01:07:02,286 --> 01:07:03,587
- I'm cold.
- Right?

1199
01:07:03,587 --> 01:07:05,589
(Ryun Gi's hand grew cold
while waiting for Ro Bin.)

1200
01:07:05,923 --> 01:07:07,758
It's okay. I'll warm it up.

1201
01:07:10,494 --> 01:07:12,129
(Heart-stopping)

1202
01:07:14,097 --> 01:07:16,533
When I took Ryun Gi's hand,

1203
01:07:16,533 --> 01:07:17,935
his hand was freezing...

1204
01:07:17,935 --> 01:07:19,670
while mine was really warm.

1205
01:07:22,039 --> 01:07:24,274
So I wanted...

1206
01:07:24,274 --> 01:07:28,245
to warm his cold hand with mine.

1207
01:07:29,179 --> 01:07:31,415
That moment felt...

1208
01:07:32,449 --> 01:07:34,084
like something out of a movie...

1209
01:07:34,084 --> 01:07:36,320
or a drama.

1210
01:07:36,486 --> 01:07:38,055
It made my heart race.

1211
01:07:43,026 --> 01:07:44,595
Honestly, for a second,

1212
01:07:44,595 --> 01:07:46,196
my mind went blank.

1213
01:07:46,196 --> 01:07:48,065
In that moment, she looked...

1214
01:07:49,132 --> 01:07:51,268
so innocent and beautiful.

1215
01:07:51,268 --> 01:07:53,337
Of course, I thought she was pretty.

1216
01:07:56,173 --> 01:07:59,243
(A moment that makes him smile
just thinking about it)

1217
01:08:00,310 --> 01:08:02,246
I want to say something too,

1218
01:08:02,246 --> 01:08:03,280
but I can't get the words out.

1219
01:08:03,747 --> 01:08:04,815
It's okay.

1220
01:08:04,815 --> 01:08:06,783
(A bashful Ro Bin...)

1221
01:08:06,783 --> 01:08:10,254
(and Ryun Gi, who finds her adorable)

1222
01:08:11,555 --> 01:08:15,592
I really don't want to go get treatment.

1223
01:08:15,792 --> 01:08:17,694
Your treatment starts tomorrow?

1224
01:08:17,694 --> 01:08:18,862
Yeah.

1225
01:08:18,862 --> 01:08:20,430
It starts tomorrow.

1226
01:08:20,430 --> 01:08:21,832
Okay. I'll wait for you.

1227
01:08:24,268 --> 01:08:26,069
What do you want after treatment?

1228
01:08:26,069 --> 01:08:27,004
Afterward?

1229
01:08:30,240 --> 01:08:31,542
I'll take you out.

1230
01:08:32,576 --> 01:08:33,677
Something with a kick.

1231
01:08:33,677 --> 01:08:35,679
- Something with a kick?
- Something spicy.

1232
01:08:35,679 --> 01:08:37,314
No spicy food.

1233
01:08:37,314 --> 01:08:38,482
I want it so badly.

1234
01:08:39,550 --> 01:08:40,717
No, you can't.

1235
01:08:42,786 --> 01:08:44,388
Then,

1236
01:08:44,388 --> 01:08:46,823
we'll get spicy food after treatment.

1237
01:08:46,823 --> 01:08:50,294
Think about where you want to go.

1238
01:08:50,294 --> 01:08:51,662
Okay.

1239
01:08:51,662 --> 01:08:53,497
- Shall we go?
- Yeah, let's go.

1240
01:08:53,497 --> 01:08:54,331
Let's go.

1241
01:08:56,233 --> 01:08:57,234
(Glances)

1242
01:08:58,502 --> 01:08:59,736
Do you want to hold hands?

1243
01:09:01,405 --> 01:09:02,306
Wait.

1244
01:09:05,108 --> 01:09:06,743
(Holds on tight)

1245
01:09:09,313 --> 01:09:10,614
- I'm cold.
- Me too.

1246
01:09:13,917 --> 01:09:17,854
Having watched Ryun Gi so closely,

1247
01:09:18,455 --> 01:09:20,524
I saw his bright side,

1248
01:09:20,524 --> 01:09:22,159
but also moments when he struggled...

1249
01:09:22,159 --> 01:09:24,328
and was in pain.

1250
01:09:24,328 --> 01:09:27,164
What stayed with me most...

1251
01:09:27,164 --> 01:09:29,299
was him saying that when he was with me,

1252
01:09:29,299 --> 01:09:31,034
he forgot about the pain.

1253
01:09:32,102 --> 01:09:35,405
I keep kind of...

1254
01:09:35,405 --> 01:09:36,273
What?

1255
01:09:36,273 --> 01:09:39,376
forgetting that I'm sick.

1256
01:09:39,376 --> 01:09:40,611
Really?

1257
01:09:40,611 --> 01:09:42,913
That's so important.

1258
01:09:42,913 --> 01:09:44,414
It's a wonderful thing.

1259
01:09:44,414 --> 01:09:47,050
Even when I'm talking to you like this,

1260
01:09:47,050 --> 01:09:48,652
I forget that I'm sick.

1261
01:09:50,821 --> 01:09:53,490
So you forget, at least,
while we're together?

1262
01:09:53,490 --> 01:09:54,291
Yeah.

1263
01:09:56,293 --> 01:09:59,096
That means a lot to me.

1264
01:10:00,230 --> 01:10:02,199
I'm so glad you told me.

1265
01:10:04,301 --> 01:10:08,205
I'm the grateful one.
You made me feel that way.

1266
01:10:10,674 --> 01:10:13,277
I was so moved when I heard him say that.

1267
01:10:15,646 --> 01:10:19,516
(The truth is, all this time, Ryun Gi...)

1268
01:10:21,618 --> 01:10:24,054
No.

1269
01:10:26,256 --> 01:10:33,230
(endured the pain that always returned...)

1270
01:10:37,167 --> 01:10:43,707
(without telling anyone...)

1271
01:10:43,707 --> 01:10:48,912
(quietly and alone.)

1272
01:10:49,279 --> 01:10:50,948
My stomach.

1273
01:10:50,948 --> 01:10:52,282
- Do you want me to pat your back?
- Yeah.

1274
01:10:54,484 --> 01:10:56,019
Here?

1275
01:10:56,019 --> 01:10:57,788
- Yes, there.
- Here?

1276
01:10:57,788 --> 01:11:00,991
(The first person Ryun Gi
ever showed his pain to)

1277
01:11:04,928 --> 01:11:06,230
Is this the spot?

1278
01:11:06,230 --> 01:11:08,365
(With Ro Bin, Ryun Gi forgot his pain.)

1279
01:11:08,365 --> 01:11:09,800
I do this for my nephew all the time.

1280
01:11:09,800 --> 01:11:12,102
- This is how you do it.
- Yes, exactly.

1281
01:11:14,037 --> 01:11:16,673
If Ryun Gi and I started dating,

1282
01:11:16,673 --> 01:11:18,609
I thought there would be so much...

1283
01:11:18,609 --> 01:11:20,611
I'd have to adjust to.

1284
01:11:20,611 --> 01:11:24,514
But by then, those worries felt pointless.

1285
01:11:24,514 --> 01:11:28,785
I realized I could let myself...

1286
01:11:28,785 --> 01:11:30,354
fall for Ryun Gi even more.

1287
01:11:30,921 --> 01:11:33,757
First of all, I want...

1288
01:11:36,527 --> 01:11:38,629
to have a delicious meal with Ryun Gi.

1289
01:11:38,996 --> 01:11:41,164
Once his treatment is over...

1290
01:11:41,164 --> 01:11:44,535
and he can eat without worrying,

1291
01:11:44,535 --> 01:11:46,670
I want to sit across from him...

1292
01:11:46,670 --> 01:11:48,438
and enjoy a delicious meal together.

1293
01:11:53,277 --> 01:11:57,881
My current chemotherapy schedule...

1294
01:11:57,881 --> 01:12:00,984
ends after the summer.

1295
01:12:05,289 --> 01:12:07,391
I wish this summer would hurry by...

1296
01:12:08,258 --> 01:12:12,496
as if I could close my eyes
and wake up when it's over.

1297
01:12:12,496 --> 01:12:14,131
I was grateful that Ro Bin...

1298
01:12:14,131 --> 01:12:17,801
told me she'd wait and not to worry...

1299
01:12:17,801 --> 01:12:20,003
and to focus on my treatment.

1300
01:12:20,204 --> 01:12:23,540
It truly felt like a fresh start,

1301
01:12:24,041 --> 01:12:26,510
so I was excited and nervous.

1302
01:12:27,844 --> 01:12:30,147
Are we supposed to hold hands like this?

1303
01:12:30,147 --> 01:12:31,815
- Why?
- Isn't this how people do it?

1304
01:12:31,815 --> 01:12:34,184
- Sorry.
- Seriously.

1305
01:12:34,418 --> 01:12:36,019
(Heart-stopping)

1306
01:12:36,019 --> 01:12:39,289
What do I do? What is happening?

1307
01:12:39,289 --> 01:12:40,490
Ro Bin...

1308
01:12:40,490 --> 01:12:41,825
is in her very first relationship.

1309
01:12:41,825 --> 01:12:42,960
- Her first relationship.
- Finally.

1310
01:12:43,193 --> 01:12:44,294
- I'm so happy for you.
- Congratulations.

1311
01:12:44,294 --> 01:12:46,630
It's really her first relationship.

1312
01:12:46,630 --> 01:12:48,065
Early on,

1313
01:12:48,065 --> 01:12:51,201
Ryun Gi still had chemotherapy ahead.

1314
01:12:51,201 --> 01:12:53,070
Ro Bin agonized over it...

1315
01:12:53,070 --> 01:12:54,438
and worried a lot.

1316
01:12:54,438 --> 01:12:56,640
It was heartbreaking to watch.

1317
01:12:56,640 --> 01:12:59,176
But in the end, they became a couple.

1318
01:12:59,176 --> 01:13:02,379
They held hands, and she said,
"I'll wait for you. Let's go."

1319
01:13:02,379 --> 01:13:03,814
That made me so emotional.

1320
01:13:03,814 --> 01:13:05,983
Ryun Gi said he forgets the pain.

1321
01:13:05,983 --> 01:13:07,384
That really stayed with me.

1322
01:13:07,384 --> 01:13:10,020
It must be so reassuring for Ryun Gi.

1323
01:13:10,220 --> 01:13:12,122
He still has more treatment ahead.

1324
01:13:12,122 --> 01:13:13,557
Having Ro Bin by his side...

1325
01:13:13,557 --> 01:13:14,825
will give him so much strength.

1326
01:13:14,825 --> 01:13:16,159
She'll protect him.

1327
01:13:16,159 --> 01:13:17,728
I hope he finishes his treatment,

1328
01:13:17,728 --> 01:13:20,531
and their love continues to blossom.

1329
01:13:20,531 --> 01:13:21,598
Same.

1330
01:13:23,734 --> 01:13:27,871
(There was someone else
waiting for Ro Bin.)

1331
01:13:34,444 --> 01:13:37,281
(10 minutes have passed.)

1332
01:13:37,281 --> 01:13:40,250
(Han Do Gon's final choice has ended.)

1333
01:13:42,052 --> 01:13:44,321
A small part of me...

1334
01:13:44,321 --> 01:13:47,090
still held onto a sliver...

1335
01:13:47,090 --> 01:13:49,159
of hope, though I knew better.

1336
01:13:50,761 --> 01:13:52,930
(Do Gon's time never reached Ro Bin.)

1337
01:13:52,930 --> 01:13:56,266
Of course I'm disappointed.
I'm only human.

1338
01:13:56,266 --> 01:14:00,370
But I don't regret a single moment.

1339
01:14:02,439 --> 01:14:04,074
I want her to stay happy...

1340
01:14:04,074 --> 01:14:06,977
and live a wonderful life.

1341
01:14:11,348 --> 01:14:13,150
I'm truly grateful...

1342
01:14:13,150 --> 01:14:15,786
for the time I spent with Ro Bin.

1343
01:14:15,786 --> 01:14:18,188
I was so happy,

1344
01:14:18,188 --> 01:14:19,790
and I'll remember it for a long time.

1345
01:14:21,358 --> 01:14:26,563
(Do Gon's heartfelt feelings for Ro Bin,
tender to the very end)

1346
01:14:31,602 --> 01:14:33,237
(10 minutes have passed.)

1347
01:14:33,237 --> 01:14:35,138
(Kim Jong Eun's final choice has ended.)

1348
01:14:35,505 --> 01:14:37,241
(10 minutes have passed.)

1349
01:14:37,241 --> 01:14:39,309
(Kang Min Young's final choice has ended.)

1350
01:14:41,445 --> 01:14:45,549
I used to think
that if two people who were ill dated,

1351
01:14:45,549 --> 01:14:47,751
they'd only double...

1352
01:14:47,751 --> 01:14:50,387
each other's pain.

1353
01:14:50,387 --> 01:14:55,325
But now I think sharing that pain...

1354
01:14:55,325 --> 01:14:56,894
might make it hurt less.

1355
01:14:57,327 --> 01:14:59,496
When I leave, I can confidently...

1356
01:14:59,963 --> 01:15:01,899
show people who I am.

1357
01:15:01,899 --> 01:15:04,635
I'm always confident.

1358
01:15:11,608 --> 01:15:14,311
I didn't find love here,

1359
01:15:15,112 --> 01:15:18,215
but my view of love has changed too.

1360
01:15:18,215 --> 01:15:20,684
Before, when it came to being sick,

1361
01:15:20,684 --> 01:15:23,120
I felt I couldn't let my partner see it.

1362
01:15:23,120 --> 01:15:25,222
I thought I had to adjust to them.

1363
01:15:25,389 --> 01:15:27,191
But here,

1364
01:15:27,191 --> 01:15:30,027
I felt comfortable showing my scars.

1365
01:15:30,861 --> 01:15:33,397
I'd never shown that side
to someone I liked,

1366
01:15:33,397 --> 01:15:35,933
so it felt wonderful.

1367
01:15:37,000 --> 01:15:39,736
Now I know I can have
a healthy relationship.

1368
01:15:41,371 --> 01:15:45,242
(A new page opens
toward the love that awaits.)

1369
01:16:08,098 --> 01:16:11,435
(Love Against Time begins in 10 minutes.)

1370
01:16:11,435 --> 01:16:15,405
(If your match does not arrive
in 10 minutes, please leave.)

1371
01:16:19,142 --> 01:16:22,079
(Love Against Time begins in 10 minutes.)

1372
01:16:22,079 --> 01:16:26,450
(If your match does not arrive
in 10 minutes, please leave.)

1373
01:16:26,650 --> 01:16:27,684
Na Young, Seon Ho, and Ye Ji.

1374
01:16:27,684 --> 01:16:28,819
(Restless)

1375
01:16:28,819 --> 01:16:30,187
Who do you all think it'll be?

1376
01:16:30,187 --> 01:16:32,489
Honestly,

1377
01:16:32,489 --> 01:16:35,626
I hope Seon Ho and Ye Ji end up together.

1378
01:16:35,626 --> 01:16:36,894
Maybe it's because...

1379
01:16:37,094 --> 01:16:39,429
we saw Ye Ji struggle so much.

1380
01:16:40,497 --> 01:16:41,798
But...

1381
01:16:41,798 --> 01:16:43,233
I have no idea.

1382
01:16:43,233 --> 01:16:45,135
Na Young also...

1383
01:16:45,135 --> 01:16:47,738
really stepped it up two days ago...

1384
01:16:48,472 --> 01:16:49,540
and gave it her all.

1385
01:16:49,540 --> 01:16:51,842
I never thought I'd get this invested.

1386
01:16:51,842 --> 01:16:52,643
This is making me lose it.

1387
01:16:52,643 --> 01:16:54,311
I'm seriously losing my mind.

1388
01:16:55,045 --> 01:16:56,413
Just fall for them.

1389
01:16:56,413 --> 01:16:57,581
Just do it.

1390
01:16:57,814 --> 01:17:00,751
(Tension that sends even introverts
into overdrive)

1391
01:17:00,751 --> 01:17:02,219
I'm going crazy. This is nerve-racking.

1392
01:17:02,219 --> 01:17:04,454
Those ten minutes must feel endless.

1393
01:17:10,027 --> 01:17:11,195
Goodness.

1394
01:17:14,831 --> 01:17:15,799
Ten minutes.

1395
01:17:32,586 --> 01:17:34,688
Hearing the words "ten minutes"...

1396
01:17:34,688 --> 01:17:38,792
made me feel pressed for time.

1397
01:17:38,792 --> 01:17:40,594
All kinds of thoughts raced
through my mind...

1398
01:17:40,594 --> 01:17:42,262
in that brief moment.

1399
01:17:44,965 --> 01:17:48,301
Time can truly drive you crazy.

1400
01:17:52,239 --> 01:17:53,773
As each minute passed,

1401
01:17:53,773 --> 01:17:55,442
it felt like time was moving too fast.

1402
01:17:56,877 --> 01:18:00,180
That's when I started getting anxious.

1403
01:18:05,685 --> 01:18:10,223
Seon Ho made my heart race the most,

1404
01:18:10,223 --> 01:18:13,226
and he was the one I saw as a man.

1405
01:18:13,226 --> 01:18:17,864
It felt like a midsummer night's dream.

1406
01:18:17,864 --> 01:18:20,433
That meant so much to me.

1407
01:18:21,134 --> 01:18:26,072
Even though he felt
something different later,

1408
01:18:26,072 --> 01:18:29,676
our first meeting...

1409
01:18:29,676 --> 01:18:34,114
felt like a story all our own.

1410
01:18:34,114 --> 01:18:36,917
I must've been all he saw in that moment.

1411
01:18:37,551 --> 01:18:40,754
Could fate really work like this?

1412
01:19:01,575 --> 01:19:04,177
Five minutes left, then four,

1413
01:19:04,177 --> 01:19:06,713
then three, and he still wasn't there.

1414
01:19:07,280 --> 01:19:08,748
So I thought, "Is this really happening?"

1415
01:19:08,748 --> 01:19:10,917
"What if he comes with one minute left?"

1416
01:19:12,018 --> 01:19:14,254
I remember every second of that wait.

1417
01:19:32,539 --> 01:19:33,840
(Smiles)

1418
01:19:35,308 --> 01:19:36,910
I was on pins and needles.

1419
01:19:37,677 --> 01:19:39,179
I felt like I was losing my mind.

1420
01:19:39,679 --> 01:19:41,848
Then I saw her silhouette in the distance.

1421
01:19:43,817 --> 01:19:46,119
I felt shy,

1422
01:19:46,119 --> 01:19:47,921
but she looked more beautiful than ever.

1423
01:19:50,924 --> 01:19:51,892
Hello.

1424
01:19:57,731 --> 01:19:58,765
Hello.

1425
01:20:03,603 --> 01:20:06,339
Honestly, it was an intense moment.

1426
01:20:09,109 --> 01:20:13,947
(The one person Seon Ho chose)

1427
01:20:20,821 --> 01:20:21,721
Hello.

1428
01:20:21,721 --> 01:20:24,591
(Final Choice, Kim Seon Ho and Jung Ye Ji)

1429
01:20:24,591 --> 01:20:28,728
(Yes! It happened!)

1430
01:20:29,229 --> 01:20:30,197
Everyone.

1431
01:20:30,397 --> 01:20:32,933
- We have a couple.
- We have a couple.

1432
01:20:32,933 --> 01:20:34,234
Congratulations.

1433
01:20:34,234 --> 01:20:36,369
She went through so much.

1434
01:20:36,369 --> 01:20:37,137
What a relief.

1435
01:20:37,137 --> 01:20:39,306
Seon Ho, no more making Ye Ji cry.

1436
01:20:39,306 --> 01:20:41,975
It's a story straight out of a movie.

1437
01:20:41,975 --> 01:20:43,743
It began when they followed
each other's blogs.

1438
01:20:43,743 --> 01:20:45,378
What an unbelievable connection.

1439
01:20:45,879 --> 01:20:47,047
I love this.

1440
01:20:47,047 --> 01:20:48,148
This is a full-on drama.

1441
01:20:48,148 --> 01:20:51,785
(A new beginning for two people
brought together by a miracle)

1442
01:20:51,985 --> 01:20:52,986
You came.

1443
01:20:52,986 --> 01:20:54,354
(Holds on tight)

1444
01:20:57,791 --> 01:21:00,193
The moment I saw Seon Ho,

1445
01:21:01,161 --> 01:21:02,496
I felt so relieved.

1446
01:21:02,496 --> 01:21:04,030
I thought, "He came for me after all."

1447
01:21:04,030 --> 01:21:07,033
I suddenly felt like I might cry.

1448
01:21:13,306 --> 01:21:14,474
Why did you take so long?

1449
01:21:14,474 --> 01:21:15,308
Weren't you cold?

1450
01:21:15,308 --> 01:21:16,643
I was freezing.

1451
01:21:17,777 --> 01:21:19,479
(Stares)

1452
01:21:20,547 --> 01:21:21,515
(Shy)

1453
01:21:24,784 --> 01:21:26,353
I don't know what to do with myself.

1454
01:21:26,353 --> 01:21:27,554
Did you think I'd come?

1455
01:21:28,221 --> 01:21:29,589
Honestly,

1456
01:21:29,589 --> 01:21:33,193
as ten minutes approached, I had no idea.

1457
01:21:33,593 --> 01:21:34,861
You thought I wasn't coming.

1458
01:21:35,862 --> 01:21:37,364
You came with just one minute left.

1459
01:21:41,034 --> 01:21:42,202
Seriously.

1460
01:21:42,202 --> 01:21:43,270
(Glances)

1461
01:21:43,603 --> 01:21:46,506
Why are you hiding behind me?

1462
01:21:52,646 --> 01:21:54,281
(Hiding)

1463
01:21:54,281 --> 01:21:56,183
(Slowly)

1464
01:21:58,819 --> 01:22:00,187
Please hide me.

1465
01:22:00,887 --> 01:22:03,223
You're supposed to hide me, Seon Ho.

1466
01:22:07,861 --> 01:22:11,598
Of course, we could've just crossed paths.

1467
01:22:11,598 --> 01:22:15,035
But I knew I'd never forget that moment.

1468
01:22:15,869 --> 01:22:18,505
You and I follow each other's blogs.

1469
01:22:18,505 --> 01:22:19,739
What? Really?

1470
01:22:19,739 --> 01:22:20,674
Yes.

1471
01:22:20,674 --> 01:22:24,344
I'd even seen your latest posts.

1472
01:22:24,744 --> 01:22:27,547
Yesterday, I wondered if it might be you.

1473
01:22:27,547 --> 01:22:29,483
(The moment they came face-to-face
with a bond that began long ago)

1474
01:22:29,483 --> 01:22:30,984
Wait, I...

1475
01:22:34,588 --> 01:22:36,790
Someone I'd cheered on years ago...

1476
01:22:36,790 --> 01:22:38,959
was here with me...

1477
01:22:38,959 --> 01:22:41,261
having this conversation.

1478
01:22:41,261 --> 01:22:43,163
It felt like a movie or a drama.

1479
01:22:44,197 --> 01:22:47,234
Back then and even now,

1480
01:22:47,234 --> 01:22:48,835
those moments were precious.

1481
01:22:49,069 --> 01:22:52,906
They were like a sandcastle...

1482
01:22:52,906 --> 01:22:56,443
we'd built together, grain by grain.

1483
01:22:59,980 --> 01:23:01,915
Those feelings...

1484
01:23:01,915 --> 01:23:05,018
were so powerful that they drew me to her.

1485
01:23:12,592 --> 01:23:14,828
We fought together, our lives at stake.

1486
01:23:15,795 --> 01:23:17,364
How could we become strangers?

1487
01:23:18,532 --> 01:23:19,800
How could we ever forget each other?

1488
01:23:29,910 --> 01:23:31,444
This is too much. What do I do?

1489
01:23:31,444 --> 01:23:32,546
What did you say?

1490
01:23:34,147 --> 01:23:36,183
I'm so cold I could cry.

1491
01:23:36,183 --> 01:23:37,184
Give me your hand.

1492
01:23:37,684 --> 01:23:38,752
Really?

1493
01:23:40,220 --> 01:23:41,154
Is that warmer?

1494
01:23:43,557 --> 01:23:46,459
(Seon Ho takes Ye Ji's cold hand.)

1495
01:23:49,529 --> 01:23:50,831
Can I have your other hand too?

1496
01:23:53,300 --> 01:23:56,102
My hands are usually really warm,

1497
01:23:56,770 --> 01:23:58,271
so I hope this helps.

1498
01:23:58,572 --> 01:24:02,209
(They hold hands for the first time.)

1499
01:24:05,846 --> 01:24:07,214
I can't take this.

1500
01:24:08,982 --> 01:24:11,985
It's the weather's fault.

1501
01:24:19,960 --> 01:24:22,762
I'm dying of embarrassment.

1502
01:24:22,762 --> 01:24:25,632
But you said your hands were cold.

1503
01:24:25,632 --> 01:24:27,000
They are, but...

1504
01:24:32,906 --> 01:24:34,841
- Your hands really are warm.
- Right?

1505
01:24:35,742 --> 01:24:38,211
How is it? Do you feel warmer now?

1506
01:24:38,211 --> 01:24:38,979
Yeah.

1507
01:24:43,450 --> 01:24:44,851
Your hands are really big.

1508
01:24:45,418 --> 01:24:47,087
Really? They aren't that big.

1509
01:24:49,856 --> 01:24:51,324
Maybe yours are just small.

1510
01:24:51,324 --> 01:24:53,727
- My hands are tiny.
- Exactly.

1511
01:24:53,727 --> 01:24:56,663
Your whole fist fits in one hand.

1512
01:25:00,400 --> 01:25:01,835
Aren't you squeezing too hard?

1513
01:25:01,835 --> 01:25:03,203
Sorry, I'm kidding.

1514
01:25:03,203 --> 01:25:04,771
With this...

1515
01:25:05,272 --> 01:25:06,239
Okay.

1516
01:25:06,807 --> 01:25:08,608
What if this leaves a handprint?

1517
01:25:08,608 --> 01:25:10,410
That's okay. You can squeeze harder.

1518
01:25:20,754 --> 01:25:23,523
(10 minutes have passed.)

1519
01:25:23,523 --> 01:25:26,026
(Kim Na Young's final choice has ended.)

1520
01:25:33,300 --> 01:25:35,435
But so what? I liked him.

1521
01:25:35,435 --> 01:25:36,703
That's all that matters.

1522
01:25:38,705 --> 01:25:40,440
I'm proud of myself.

1523
01:25:40,440 --> 01:25:43,243
Once I came to that conclusion,

1524
01:25:43,243 --> 01:25:44,544
I felt so much lighter.

1525
01:25:44,878 --> 01:25:47,814
Most of all, when we were together,

1526
01:25:47,814 --> 01:25:50,250
I laughed and felt happy.

1527
01:25:50,250 --> 01:25:52,252
That's what I remember most.

1528
01:25:52,252 --> 01:25:53,854
And I truly meant it.

1529
01:25:55,322 --> 01:25:56,756
(Touched)

1530
01:25:56,756 --> 01:25:58,258
We could feel it.

1531
01:26:00,360 --> 01:26:03,997
Na Young tried so hard.

1532
01:26:04,364 --> 01:26:06,399
- She was incredible.
- She never held back.

1533
01:26:06,399 --> 01:26:07,801
She truly gave it her all.

1534
01:26:09,402 --> 01:26:14,241
(Moments that will forever shine
in Na Young's memories)

1535
01:26:14,841 --> 01:26:17,010
No matter what you choose,

1536
01:26:17,010 --> 01:26:19,713
I want you to know you did so well,

1537
01:26:20,714 --> 01:26:22,115
and I'll always be rooting for you.

1538
01:26:29,890 --> 01:26:32,759
We've both gone through illness,

1539
01:26:32,759 --> 01:26:34,561
so we share that experience.

1540
01:26:35,395 --> 01:26:36,930
When you look at me,

1541
01:26:37,430 --> 01:26:39,666
does it remind you of the past?

1542
01:26:39,666 --> 01:26:41,067
Not in this moment.

1543
01:26:42,936 --> 01:26:48,542
(Their time begins to flow together.)

1544
01:26:50,143 --> 01:26:54,381
(Love Against Time)

1545
01:26:54,381 --> 01:26:56,550
(Epilogue)

1546
01:26:58,251 --> 01:26:59,386
This is the end, right?

1547
01:26:59,386 --> 01:27:00,520
It is.

1548
01:27:00,520 --> 01:27:01,588
It went by so fast.

1549
01:27:01,588 --> 01:27:03,290
I'm really sad it's over.

1550
01:27:03,290 --> 01:27:06,092
The four of us had amazing chemistry.

1551
01:27:06,092 --> 01:27:07,060
We were a riot.

1552
01:27:07,060 --> 01:27:09,596
Of course, all eight were incredible.

1553
01:27:09,596 --> 01:27:11,298
But...

1554
01:27:11,298 --> 01:27:12,966
I can say without a doubt...

1555
01:27:12,966 --> 01:27:13,834
He's hilarious.

1556
01:27:13,834 --> 01:27:15,936
that the four of us were incredible too.

1557
01:27:15,936 --> 01:27:17,137
- It was truly the best.
- We worked hard too.

1558
01:27:17,137 --> 01:27:18,305
The four of us.

1559
01:27:18,839 --> 01:27:20,140
Great work, everyone.

1560
01:27:20,140 --> 01:27:21,174
Congratulations.

1561
01:27:21,174 --> 01:27:23,210
- Congratulations.
- Congratulations.

1562
01:27:25,946 --> 01:27:28,582
- Great work.
- "Are you feeling tipsy?"

1563
01:27:29,282 --> 01:27:30,951
(Kim Ryun Gi)

1564
01:27:30,951 --> 01:27:32,619
(Kim Seon Ho)

1565
01:27:32,619 --> 01:27:34,287
(Kim Jong Eun)

1566
01:27:34,287 --> 01:27:35,956
(Han Do Gon)

1567
01:27:35,956 --> 01:27:37,624
(Kang Min Young)

1568
01:27:37,624 --> 01:27:39,292
(Kim Na Young)

1569
01:27:39,292 --> 01:27:40,961
(Seo Ro Bin)

1570
01:27:40,961 --> 01:27:42,629
(Jung Ye Ji)

1571
01:28:00,280 --> 01:28:02,249
(Thank you for watching
Love Against Time.)

1572
